"Taekwondo is the national sport of Korea, and was used by the South Korean "
"army in the 20th century.  Focused on kicks, it does not benefit from wielded "
"weapons.  It also includes strength training; your blocks absorb extra damage "
"and your attacks do more damage if you are not holding anything."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Taekwondo"
msgid "You adopt a narrow fighting stance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/martialarts.json
#. ~ Initiate message of martial art "Taekwondo"
#, c-format
msgid "%s adopts a narrow fighting stance."
