#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "EOD jacket"
msgid ""
"A thick armored jacket constructed from Kevlar, Nomex, and foam padding, for "
"use by explosive ordnance disposal technicians.  It features a central pocket "
"for a large plate, and near complete coverage in fragmentation resistant "
"materials.  Aside from the plate, it offers insufficient protection from "
"ballistic threats."
msgstr ""

