msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/items/armor/ballistic_armor.json
#. ~ Description of "EOD fragmentation plate"
msgid ""
"A polygonal fragmentation plate with a slightly concave profile, made of thin "
"layers of steel, UHMW polyethylene, foam, and Kevlar.  Though certified to "
"provide protection from fragmentation, it will not provide much protection "
"from firearms.  This is intended to be inserted into an EOD suit, and can't "
"be worn on its own."
msgstr ""

