msgid ""
"Who made the Bermuda Triangle?  How did they build Stonehenge?  What did the "
"alien king whisper in Cleopatra's ear that passionate night in the dunes?  "
"These answers and more in the Alien Theorists' latest exposé."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/book/misc_newage.json
#. ~ Item name
msgid "Your Year in Horoscopes"
msgid_plural "copies of Your Year in Horoscopes"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
