#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
#. ~ Description of gun "Luger P08 pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Luger P08 pistol"
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic 9x19mm military issued pistol with an unusual toggle-lock "
"action.  Well-known for its use by the Germans during both World Wars, it's a "
"notably accurate handgun even by modern standards, and this example of a P08 "
"was more than likely either brought back state-side as a war trophy by a "
"veteran, or imported."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/gun/9mm.json
