msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "eigenspectre"
msgid ""
"This is the opposite of a human silhouette; every facet of every detail on "
"display, with no shape to make sense of them.  You can see both sides of an "
"ID badge on a white labcoat.  You can see every muscle and nerve in eyes "
"blown wide with horror."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "eigenspectre"
#. ~ Death message of monster "shifting eigenspectre"
#. ~ Death message of monster "titanic eigenspectre"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s becomes part of the endless chamber."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "photonic eigenspectre"
msgid_plural "photonic eigenspectres"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "photonic eigenspectre"
msgid ""
"The endless details of this figure are mercifully obscured by the viscous "
"light coursing 'through' it.  It cannot contain anything, but the smears of "
"light follow the shapes of stomach and intestines, and are splattered across "
"what must be the lips and chin."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "photonic eigenspectre"
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s becomes part of the endless chamber, and congealed light splashes away "
"from the spot it occupied."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "photonic eigenspectre"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s emits a torrent of congealed light!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "photonic eigenspectre"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s flings a gobbet of congealed light!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shifting eigenspectre"
msgid_plural "shifting eigenspectres"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shifting eigenspectre"
msgid ""
"This distorted figure is a kaleidoscope of borders.  Every part of a human, "
"flattened into place, warps wildly from second to second.  The word your mind "
"conjures to describe it is 'rotating', though you're not sure why."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shifting eigenspectre"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is in two places at once, and leaves something of itself behind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "titanic eigenspectre"
msgid_plural "titanic eigenspectres"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "titanic eigenspectre"
msgid ""
"There is somehow more of this figure than the others.  Every side of every "
"surface is on display, but each of those seems like the thin edge of a larger "
"shape.  There is an eternity here, where a scientist used to be."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "unfolded impossibility"
msgid_plural "unfolded impossibilities"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of monster "unfolded impossibility"
msgid ""
"This is the entirety of the infinite chamber you are in, which perfectly "
"contains itself.  If you look very closely, you might see yourself looking "
"back.  You are sure that at any other time, seeing this would crack your "
"brain like an eggshell.  But you understand it just fine right now.  And you "
"can see it breathing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "unfolded impossibility"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s rapidly rearranges the coordinates of the infinite chamber."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/LIXA_monsters.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unfolded impossibility"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s rearranges the parts of itself you occupy, dilating them around you."
msgstr ""

