#: data/json/monsters/defense_bot.json
#. ~ Description of monster "refurbished autonomous TALON UGV Liberty Edition"
msgid ""
"Once a Talon UGV bot converted to shoot fireworks at trespassers, this has "
"been refurbished and uses it's M16A4 once more.  It still has the American "
"flag decal from it's service as a trespass deterrent."
msgstr ""

