#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cottontail rabbit"
msgid ""
"A brown-coated cottontail rabbit, with a fluffy white tail.  Its small size "
"and docile nature makes it easy prey for predators, at least the ones that "
"can catch it.  You can't tell which one of the two cottontail species from "
"the region this is."
msgstr ""

