msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
#. ~ Description of monster "camouflaged mutant"
msgid ""
"A mutated test subject, running on all fours at alarming speed.  Their short "
"fur changes color to match the background in an instant, making you struggle "
"to keep the thing in focus.  Their thin limbs end in long talons, and their "
"mouth is held perpetually open by a set of knife-sized fangs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
