msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "slavering coyote"
msgid ""
"Unnatural bulges line the neck of this obviously-mutated coyote; green-tinted "
"foam flecks from its lips, and there's a crazed look in its eyes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "slavering coyote pup"
msgid_plural "slavering coyote pups"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spideer"
msgid_plural "spideers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spideer"
msgid ""
"This once-ordinary deer has grown a disturbingly agile array of extra limbs, "
"plus three extra eyes.  Its antlers wriggle subtly in the wind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spideer fawn"
msgid_plural "spideer fawns"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spideer fawn"
msgid ""
"This obviously mutated adolescent deer moves unsteadily on its eight legs, "
"nervously scanning the area with all five eyes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "mongrel"
msgid_plural "mongrels"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "mongrel"
msgid ""
"This dog of unidentifiable breed looks like it has seen better days.  Its "
"wiry hair is patchy, revealing scales underneath, but it still happily wags "
"its tails anyways."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Loper"
msgid_plural "Lopers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Loper"
msgid ""
"This dog has undergone visible mutation.  While its body is larger than "
"normal, its legs are noticeably elongated, muscular and covered in long "
"cord-like fur.  It easily stands as tall as you and watches your every move "
"closely with reflective eyes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Loper puppy"
msgid_plural "Loper puppies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Loper puppy"
msgid ""
"An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something about "
"its legs seems off."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Mauler"
msgid_plural "Maulers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Mauler"
msgid ""
"This stocky dog has undergone visible mutation.  Its jaw has widened and "
"features more teeth than any dog should ever have.  While its toothy grin is "
"unnerving, its tail wags as energetically as ever."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Mauler puppy"
msgid_plural "Mauler puppies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Mauler puppy"
msgid ""
"An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something about "
"its mouth seems off."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Thrasher"
msgid_plural "Thrashers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Thrasher"
msgid ""
"This dog has undergone visible mutation.  Its paws are larger than normal and "
"have developed long digging nails.  Its fur is extremely short, barely "
"covering its leathery skin."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Thrasher puppy"
msgid_plural "Thrasher puppies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Thrasher puppy"
msgid ""
"An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something about "
"its paws seems off."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "dextrous raccoon"
msgid_plural "dextrous raccoons"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "dextrous raccoon"
msgid ""
"Its paws have grown to be longer, and it seems capable of briefly standing on "
"its hindlimbs.  You wonder if this sleazy beast is able to open doors yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "albino penguin"
msgid_plural "albino penguins"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "albino penguin"
msgid ""
"An eight-foot-tall, ghastly white penguin.  Its muscular body suggests "
"immense strength, but it seems placid unless otherwise provoked."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "amigara horror"
msgid_plural "amigara horrors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "amigara horror"
msgid ""
"A hellish, vaguely humanoid horror, two stories tall.  Its face is "
"grotesquely stretched out, its limbs deformed to unrecognizable outgrowths."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "blank body"
msgid_plural "blank bodies"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "blank body"
msgid ""
"This is some form of unnatural changeling creature; its appearance is a bland "
"mockery of the human form.  Featureless and pale, its repugnant countenance "
"is all the more unsettling due to its lack of eyes and distinguishing "
"features except for a perfectly round mouth.  Adding to its unearthly "
"appearance is the way it moves, stiff and doll-like as though it was only "
"feigning knowing how to walk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "blood sacrifice"
msgid_plural "blood sacrifices"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#. ~ Description of monster "blood sacrifice"
msgid ""
"A defiled human body, once living.  Tortured to death long ago, it remains "
"chained to the altar, the putrescent flays of its peeled skin quivering like "
"so much flotsam upon a murky pond."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_floraxeno.json
