#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Yrax apeirohedron"
#, c-format
msgid "The %s folds away."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid_plural "Yrax quadraphracts"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid ""
"A gleaming, burnished gold, four legged structure the size of a small "
"vehicle, but much taller; this looks vaguely robotic, but too smooth and "
"perfect to fit in this world.  Its legs are smooth faceted figures, with no "
"visible joints, and hold its gem-like body aloft with an eery, sculpted "
"grace.  At the peak of the gem-body is a deep, goblet-shaped crown that "
"slowly swivels about, pointing at nothing in specific.  Though nothing about "
"its appearance is familiar to you, it nevertheless strikes you with a mixture "
"of awe and dread."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid "The quadraphract collapses, dead at last."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid "reality seems to warp around the quadraphract's crown as it fires."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "Yrax quadraphract"
msgid "a deep thrumming sound."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "quadraphract leg"
msgid_plural "quadraphract legs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "quadraphract leg"
msgid ""
"A morphing lune of burnished gold attached to the greater structure.  "
"Seemingly jointless it moves with a fluid grace, allowing the quadraphract to "
"glide aboveground with a speed and agility that belies its size."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Death message of monster "quadraphract leg"
msgid "The quadraphract stumbles as one of its legs looses coherence and collapses."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Yrax delta"
msgid_plural "Yrax deltas"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax delta"
msgid ""
"A kite shaped blade of metal, darting through air and foes by indiscernible "
"means."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Yrax delta"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "charged amalgamation"
#, c-format
msgid "A bolt of electricity arcs from %s!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal dog"
msgid_plural "skeletal dogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal dog"
msgid ""
"This undead canine has shed all of its skin, revealing a carapace of fused "
"bones and ribs.  This walking suit of bone seems to be controlled by a net of "
"veins and sinews which pulse with glistening black goo."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "barghest"
msgid_plural "barghests"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "barghest"
msgid ""
"A huge swollen zombie dog, smeared black with slime.  Its teeth have grown "
"longer, and its broad back ripples with muscles and oozing wounds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "cuspated dog"
msgid_plural "cuspated dogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "cuspated dog"
msgid ""
"This dog's snout and jaw have seemingly fused together, the skin and flesh "
"ranging from completely gone to barely hanging on.  The boney mass as a whole "
"has an incredibly sharp yet jagged point.  It stumbles around, barely keeping "
"its hefty 'beak' from hitting the ground."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "howling dog"
msgid_plural "howling dogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "howling dog"
msgid ""
"The underbelly of this undead canine expands and contracts arrhythmically, "
"almost like it's breathing.  Despite that, it is clearly in an advanced state "
"of decomposition.  Its snout and throat appear far too large for its species, "
"and the remains of its eyes appear much more analytical than its brethren."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched dog"
msgid_plural "scorched dogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched dog"
msgid ""
"A charred and damaged corpse of a canid, covered in fused patches of burnt "
"hide and flesh."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "hulking horror"
msgid_plural "hulking horrors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "hulking horror"
msgid ""
"What may once have been a dog is now a grotesquely swollen monstrosity, "
"standing on four limbs as wide as trash cans and showing massive, jagged "
"teeth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scorched hulking dog"
msgid_plural "scorched hulking dogs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scorched hulking dog"
msgid ""
"A charred and damaged corpse of what you can only assume was once a horribly "
"mutated dog.  Covering its entire body is a layer of fused and melted hide, "
"giving it an armored appearance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "boneplate wolf"
msgid_plural "boneplate wolves"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "boneplate wolf"
msgid ""
"A four-legged creature covered in fused bony plates, shaped somewhat like a "
"dog or wolf.  Joints and cracks across its body ooze with black goo."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skull pig"
msgid_plural "skull pigs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skull pig"
msgid ""
"This undead boar appears to have been a truly massive specimen in life.  "
"Stretching eight to nine feet in length, the most arresting feature of this "
"animal is that the enamel of its tusks has spread across its face, leaving a "
"skull-like appearance with deep-set eye holes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "trench pig"
msgid_plural "trench pigs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "trench pig"
msgid ""
"Billowing clouds of yellowish gas precede a boar-shaped shadow.  Glimpses of "
"a zombified boar are quickly obscured by the gases spewing forth from the "
"open wounds on its body."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal wolf"
msgid_plural "skeletal wolves"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal wolf"
msgid ""
"This undead canine has shed all of its skin, revealing a carapace of fused "
"bones and ribs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "spearcat hunter"
msgid_plural "spearcat hunters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "spearcat hunter"
msgid ""
"This undead cougar's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its fur is torn, "
"revealing deep, festering wounds.  Its claws and teeth are unnaturally long, "
"and sharpened into dangerous looking spikes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "skeletal zombear"
msgid_plural "skeletal zombears"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal zombear"
msgid ""
"As if a zombified bear wasn't already a problem, this one is layered in thick "
"bone growths that protect it from harm.  The irregular way the plates grow "
"against each other has somewhat stifled its movement, but not enough to stop "
"it from easily gaining up on you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "shadowcat"
msgid_plural "shadowcats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "shadowcat"
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature, as if light itself were too "
"repulsed to touch it.  All you can make out is the outline of a large, "
"shambling cat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic zombear"
msgid_plural "acidic zombears"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombear"
msgid ""
"Most of this bear's fur has burnt off and its body looks to be falling apart, "
"not entirely immune to its own acidic fluids.  Despite its weakened state, "
"the strength of a bear hasn't left it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "acidic zombie horse"
msgid_plural "acidic zombie horses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombie horse"
msgid ""
"The abdomen of this once majestic horse has grown rotund to the point you can "
"see through the skin, at the reservoir of caustic bile inside.  Its neck is "
"equally enlarged as well as slightly longer than normal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "sinewy warhorse"
msgid_plural "sinewy warhorses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "sinewy warhorse"
msgid ""
"A zombified horse without skin, its overgrown, bloody musculature clear for "
"all to see.  Some muscles occasionally tear from their tendons as it barrels "
"towards its target, flailing around like a loose hose before weaving back "
"into place."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "smoldering stallion"
msgid_plural "smoldering stallions"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "smoldering stallion"
msgid ""
"This undead horse has a charred hide as black as soot, the underside of which "
"is littered with gashes and holes.  Pillars of choking black smoke pour from "
"the wounds, smothering everything that draws near."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "pale charger"
msgid_plural "pale chargers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "pale charger"
msgid ""
"With plates of asymmetrical bone tissue overlapping its body, this ignoble "
"steed needs no rider for you to fear its approach.  Completing its ghoulish "
"look is an overgrown skull which, judging by the flattened and battered "
"forehead, has become its main weapon."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "antlered hammer"
msgid_plural "antlered hammers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "antlered hammer"
msgid ""
"This once-great moose's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its flesh is "
"torn and scarred.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, "
"festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"Dříve majestátnému losu nyní z očí vytéká temná, olejnatá tekutina a jeho "
"tkáně jsou roztrhané a zjizvené. Celé jeho tělo bobtná plno nateklých svalů a "
"mokvajících ran."

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "thorny moose shambler"
msgid_plural "thorny moose shamblers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zanimal_upgrade.json
#. ~ Description of monster "thorny moose shambler"
msgid ""
"This once-great moose is covered with long, matted hair twisted with thorny "
"vines that wrap together and then twist back into its body.  Long, "
"interlocking thorns wrap its antlers, dripping with a silvery liquid."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "jawed terror"
msgid_plural "jawed terrors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "jawed terror"
msgid ""
"Once a normally-aggressive, normally-hungry bull shark, this undead terror is "
"now even more aggressive and more hungry, possibly thanks to its lack of a "
"functioning brain."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "abyssal terror"
msgid_plural "abyssal terrors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "abyssal terror"
msgid ""
"Once a former apex predator of the seas, now an undead nightmare, this "
"zombified Great White shark terrorizes the waters with its relentless hunger "
"and aggression."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie dog"
msgid_plural "zombie dogs"
msgstr[0] "zombie pes"
msgstr[1] "zombie psi"
msgstr[2] "zombie psů"
msgstr[3] "zombie psi"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie dog"
msgid ""
"The deformed, animated corpse of a canine; a sinewy beast which can easily "
"outpace its two-legged friends."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "Z-9"
msgid_plural "Z-9s"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "Z-9"
msgid ""
"A zombified version of one of the German Shepherd dogs used in law "
"enforcement.  Its deformed body is encased in a protective Kevlar harness."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "rot-weiler"
msgid_plural "rot-weilers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "rot-weiler"
msgid ""
"An acrid smell accompanies this animated canine corpse.  Its whole body is "
"covered in chains of pulsing cysts and slime-dribbling ulcers."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "grim howler"
msgid_plural "grim howlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "grim howler"
msgid ""
"A zombified wolf.  Its mouth oozes with a black substance, coating its "
"vicious-looking white fangs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombear"
msgid_plural "zombears"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombear"
msgid ""
"This black bear's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its flesh is torn and "
"scarred.  It shuffles as it walks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "festering boar"
msgid_plural "festering boars"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "festering boar"
msgid ""
"A zombified omnivore descended from the wild boar.  Now it's got black goo "
"all over it, instead of mud."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombeaver"
msgid_plural "zombeavers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombeaver"
msgid ""
"This wall-eyed beast has a large wound on its side, its gore-stained ribs "
"clearly visible.  Its most prominent features are the fearsome incisors "
"dribbling thick, black goo from inside its mouth.  It doesn't look interested "
"in chewing on trees anymore."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "antlered horror"
msgid_plural "antlered horrors"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "antlered horror"
msgid ""
"This formerly-majestic moose has succumbed to the infection that is killing "
"the world.  Shiny green blowflies swarm the vast, suppurated patches of "
"purulent flesh where its skin has sloughed away, and its remaining fur is "
"black and matted with necrotic discharge."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "decayed pouncer"
msgid_plural "decayed pouncers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "decayed pouncer"
msgid ""
"A normal-looking cougar, except that its hind legs are swollen, and its eyes "
"bulge with black goo."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie horse"
msgid_plural "zombie horses"
msgstr[0] "zombie kůň"
msgstr[1] "zombie koně"
msgstr[2] "zombie koňí"
msgstr[3] "zombie koně"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie horse"
msgid ""
"From the deteriorated state of this undead horse's ghastly "
"features--protruding ribs, off-white skull, and decayed, tattered muscles--it "
"doesn't seem like it should put up much of a fight, but something deep inside "
"gives it power.  Black, reeking ichor drips from its wounds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "tiger wight"
msgid_plural "tiger wights"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "tiger wight"
msgid ""
"This tiger stumbles and sways, its jaws slack, its eyes wide open and shining "
"black."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie sheep"
msgid_plural "zombie sheep"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie sheep"
msgid ""
"This sheep's once pure white wool is now barely hanging by its rotten flesh, "
"held together by dried mud and blood.  Its legs now buckle as the rotten "
"muscles have a hard time sustaining the rest of the body."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie goat"
msgid_plural "zombie goats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie goat"
msgid ""
"The moving corpse of what once was a goat is now left stumbling around, with "
"pitch black empty eyes, looking for anything alive to kill."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie cow"
msgid_plural "zombie cows"
msgstr[0] "zombie kráva"
msgstr[1] "zombie krávy"
msgstr[2] "zombie krav"
msgstr[3] "zombie krávy"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie cow"
msgid ""
"Once a placid cow, this leathery horror stumbles and shudders, its pulsing "
"black eyes scanning for prey.  Dairy cows have no natural weapons, but a "
"zombie as big, heavy, and murderous as this is still extremely dangerous."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombull"
msgid_plural "zombulls"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombull"
msgid ""
"This enormous, terrifyingly fast creature with oily black eyes and dreadful "
"horns was once a domestic bull.  While live bulls can be temperamental, "
"unbridled rage is now this one's only emotion."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie llama"
msgid_plural "zombie llamas"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie llama"
msgid ""
"This llama oozes a dark oil from a multitude of lesions and cuts.  Its wool "
"has sloughed off with parts of its skin, revealing pulsating muscles and "
"flesh.  Its mouth drips with a sickly green substance which it seems to be "
"chewing on."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "zombie llama"
msgid "The vicious vicuña spits a glob of acid!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "woodland wight"
msgid_plural "woodland wights"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "woodland wight"
msgid ""
"A pale, stumbling, white-tailed deer, rivulets of slime running down its "
"neck.  Its limbs twist and bend in unnatural, haphazard directions, and yet "
"it moves with uncanny strength and speed.  Thanks to the Cataclysm, it has "
"now turned the tables; what was once prey, now itself preys on coyotes, "
"wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "zombie reindeer"
msgid_plural "zombie reindeers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie reindeer"
msgid ""
"Once a majestic caribou, this undead creature barely resembles Santa's "
"helpful reindeer and seems to only be interested in human flesh."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json data/json/monsters/zed_dormant.json
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags.json
#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie>"
msgid "zombie"
msgid_plural "zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombie"
msgstr[1] "zombie"
msgstr[2] "zombie"
msgstr[3] "zombie"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "zombie"
msgid ""
"A human body, swaying as it moves, an unstoppable rage visible in its oily "
"black eyes."
msgstr ""
"Tělo člověka. Při chůzi se kymácí a v jeho olejovitých černých očích se zračí "
"nezastavitelná zloba."

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Monster name
msgid "scarred zombie"
msgid_plural "scarred zombies"
msgstr[0] "zjizvený zommbie"
msgstr[1] "zjizvení zombie"
msgstr[2] "zjizvených zombií"
msgstr[3] "zjizvené zombie"

#: data/json/monsters/zed-classic.json
#. ~ Description of monster "scarred zombie"
msgid ""
