#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Sugar Beet Seeds"
msgid ""
"Sugar and molasses remains in short supply.  I've put in a request for more, "
"but it is unlikely that I'm going to see a reliable source for some time.  If "
"you are interested, we are going to need sugar beet seeds to meet future "
"demand regardless of what the scavengers can find.  Could you bring me at "
"least enough seeds to plant a small 10 meter long patch?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Sugar Beet Seeds"
msgid "Farms or supply stores might have a few seeds…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Sugar Beet Seeds"
msgid "Do you have the sugar beet seeds?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find 12 60-Liter Metal Tanks"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 60-Liter Metal Tanks"
msgid ""
"The drinks we brew here have become a major draw for visitors and the "
"occasional trader.  Our batches have become larger, but we are still running "
"out of storage space between trading runs.  I've been able to get a few "
"volunteers to help me build a set of standing tanks, but I still need 12 "
"60-liter metal tanks to build them.  I've talked with the scrappers, but we "
"are a low priority at the moment."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 60-Liter Metal Tanks"
msgid "Scrapping vehicles might be your best bet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 60-Liter Metal Tanks"
msgid "Do you have the 60-liter metal tanks?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find 2 200-Liter Drums"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 200-Liter Drums"
msgid ""
"The other survivor outposts that we have contact with have been more than "
"eager to trade for beer or other drinks.  Transporting the drinks to them has "
"presented a number of challenges though.  If you could locate a pair of "
"200-liter drums, we should be able to keep them supplied while turning a "
"significant profit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 200-Liter Drums"
msgid "Factories or junk yards are the only places I know where to look."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 200-Liter Drums"
msgid "Do you have the 200-liter drums?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My partner is in charge of fortifying this place, you should ask him about "
"what needs to be done."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll talk to him then…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Howdy."
msgstr "Zdar."

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Flavor
msgid "Crop Overseer"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I hope you are here to do business."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I figured you might be looking for some help…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm interested in investing in agriculture…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like to discuss my field…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you need done?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My job is to manage our outpost's agricultural production.  I'm constantly "
"searching for trade partners and investors to increase our capacity.  If you "
"are interested, I typically have tasks that I need assistance with."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Back to check on your field?  What can I help you with?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"There's a field on the other side of the house that isn't being used for "
"anything right now.  We're willing to let you purchase it for your own "
"agricultural enterprises if you're interested."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Tell me more about this field."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can you build a fence around my field?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm looking to expand my field…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like to plant some seeds…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like to harvest some plants…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We'll help plow the land and put up a sign to let everybody know it's yours.  "
"Once it's plowed, you can hire some workers to plant or harvest the crops for "
"a small fee of course.  Oh, and if you're growing anything we have a demand "
"for, we'll gladly take it off your hands after the harvest."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm interested.  How much is it going to cost?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "350 merch should be enough to cover the purchase and the labor to plow it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[350 merch] Seems like a fair price.  I'll take it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"<npc_name> jots your name down on a ledger and yells out to nearby laborers "
"to begin plowing your new field."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm a bit short right now.  <end_talking_later>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Sure, we could build a sturdy picket fence around it that will keep most "
"wildlife from nibbling at your crops.  Your crop yields will increase "
"slightly as well."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We'll have to divert a decent amount of lumber from our other projects for "
"the fence, but we can get it done for 200 merch."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[200 merch] Alright, build me a fence."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"After counting your money, <npc_name> directs a nearby laborer to begin "
"constructing a fence around your plot…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I don't have that much right now.  <end_talking_later>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We'll have to divert a decent amount of lumber from our other projects for "
"the fence, but we can get it done for 300 merch."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[300 merch] Alright, build me a fence."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We can plow some more land around your field to give you room for more "
"plants.  Any existing plants or items in the way will be destroyed.  The "
"fence will also get moved and expanded.  Everything can be done for 200 "
"merch.  Still interested?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We can plow some more land around your field to give you room for more "
"plants.  Any existing plants or items in the way will be destroyed.  It'll "
"only cost 100 merch to expand.  Still interested?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[200 merch] Yeah, let's do it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[100 merch] Yeah, let's do it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We'll plant the field with your choice of crop if you are willing to finance "
"it.  When the crop is ready to harvest, you can have us liquidate it or "
"harvest it for you.  Planting will cost 1 merch per plot."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[1 merch / plot] I'd like to plant some seeds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You can either have us liquidate the crop and give you the cash or pay us to "
"harvest it for you.  Harvesting will cost 1 merch per plot."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[1 merch / plot] I'd like to harvest the field."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "How can I help you today?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm sorry, I don't have time to help you at the moment."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Is there anything else I can help with?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Maybe I could help you with something?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I couldn't find any crutches, but I made these.  Will they work?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "These will have to do…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I have other patients to attend to.  Come back later."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I can't right now, I have other matters to attend to."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[80 merch, 30m] I need you to patch me up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[200 merch, 1h] I need you to patch my friends up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "If you mean something like pacemaker, then maybe.  What's the trouble?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"If you mean something like pacemaker, we can't really do much without "
"anesthesia."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"No, i mean something, eeh, more sci-fi.  There are robo-guys in a stone "
"castle, they say they have such technology.  They even installed something "
"into me, look!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"No, i mean something, eeh, more sci-fi.  There are robo-guys in a stone "
"castle, they say they have such technology."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Curious.  Sorry, i have no idea how it works, and i'd be afraid to even touch "
"this parts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Are you all right?  Sci-fi bionic by robots in a stone castle?  I have some "
"antipsychotics, if it helps."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm running out of office supplies.  I know… of all the things to need at a "
"time like this!  I just need to be able to keep track of and organize medical "
"records so that I can focus on helping people.  Ten binders and a ream of "
"paper should tide me over until some shipments come in."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll see what I can find."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Thanks, this will help a lot."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Collect Office Supplies"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Collect Office Supplies"
msgid ""
"The doctor needs office supplies to keep track of medical records.  Bring "
"them 10 Book binders and 500 paper."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect Office Supplies"
msgid "Have you found the supplies yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect Office Supplies"
msgid "Thanks!  This should help keep things organized for a while."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "A Crutch to Lean on"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Description of mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
msgid "Bring the doctor some crutches."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
msgid ""
"One of the laborers injured their foot pretty badly and I don't want them "
"walking on it for a few days at least.  Do you think you could find a pair of "
"crutches?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 Car Batteries"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 5 Backpacks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of Homebrewer's Bible"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 80lb (10000 units) of Sugar"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 30 Glass Sheets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Simple Knife Spears"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Leather Body Armor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
msgid "I'm counting on you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
msgid ""
"You might be able to find some in hospitals, but some makeshift crutches "
"would be better than nothing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
msgid "Do you have the crutches?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
msgid "Bring the doctor 5 pairs of medical gloves."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
msgid ""
"We're getting a lot of scrapes and bruises coming in right now, but it's only "
"a matter of time before we see a serious injury.  I'm not prepared for when "
"that happens and I'm hoping you can help.  To start off, I'm going to need "
"some more medical gloves to help prevent infections.  Can you bring me 5 "
"pairs?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
msgid "Hospitals or clinics might have a few sitting around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
msgid "Do you have the medical gloves?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
msgid ""
"Bring the doctor 3000 units of anesthetic.  Ask around the commune for "
"assistance in building an anesthetic machine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
msgid ""
"I want to make sure we are setup to handle any major surgeries that come our "
"way, but pain management is going to be an issue.  For longer surgeries, "
"we're going to need some anesthetic.  Can you bring me 3000 units to start?  "
"We're also going to need an anesthetic machine to deliver it.  Maybe some "
"people around the commune can help with that?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
msgid "Hospitals or clinics might have some.  Labs could have some as well."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
msgid "Any progress on getting some anesthetic or parts?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
msgid ""
"The scavengers found more medical equipment than I expected and with the help "
"from the scrappers, I've been able to get most of it up and running.  I "
"should be able to perform more operations now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like to hire your services."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I was sent here to assist in setting up the farm.  Most of us have no real "
"skills that transfer from before the Cataclysm, so things are a bit of trial "
"and error."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I don't have anything to trade.  The work program here splits what "
"we produce between the refugee center, the farm, and ourselves.  If you are a "
"skilled laborer, then you can trade your time for a bit of extra income on "
"the side.  Not much I can do to assist you as a farmer though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You mind?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm just a lucky guy that went from being chased by the undead to the noble "
"life of a dirt farmer.  We get room and board, but won't see a share of our "
"labor unless the crop is a success."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It could be worse…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I've got no time for you.  If you want to make a trade or need a job, look "
"for the foreman or crop overseer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll talk with them then…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Appears at the ranch after you progress in the refugee center quests.
#. Faction critical.
msgid "Foreman"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Hello again.  If you have no other business with me, I'd like to talk to you "
"about something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Can I help you, marshal?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Morning sir, how can I help you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Morning ma'am, how can I help you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "The merchant at the Refugee Center sent me to get a prospectus from you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I heard you were setting up an outpost out here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What's your job here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Hey, are you looking for workers here?  I know a couple people back at the "
"refugee center that might be willing to come."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hey, are you looking for workers here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'm afraid I don't have anything to offer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I don't have anything to offer, but maybe the scrappers could help find some "
"materials."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I don't have anything to offer, but maybe the scavenger boss could help find "
"some materials."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I don't have anything to offer, but you could talk to the scavenger boss and "
"the scrappers; They might be able to help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks anyway."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Ya, that representative from the Old Guard asked the two of us to come out "
"here and begin fortifying this place as a refugee camp.  I'm not sure how "
"fast he expects the two of us to get setup, but we were assured additional "
"men were coming out here to assist us. "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How many refugees are you expecting?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hopefully moving out here was worth it…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm the engineer in charge of turning this place into a working camp.  This "
"is going to be an uphill battle, we used most of our initial supplies getting "
"here and boarding up the windows.  I've got a huge list of tasks that need to "
"get done, so if you could help us keep supplied I'd appreciate it.  If you "
"have material to drop off you can just back your vehicle into here and dump "
"it on the ground, we'll sort it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We're still in early stages of getting set up, but we're not overly flush for "
"hands, that's for sure.  If they're willing to put in a hard day's work, we "
"can get them busy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll tell them that, but they seemed good for a bit of hard labor."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"we're still in early stages of getting set up, but we're not overly flush for "
"hands, that's for sure.  I don't think we'd turn many people away, of course, "
"but besides strong hands and willing labor, we could really use someone who "
"could cook.  I can't tell you what it'd do for morale.  You could try asking "
"some of the people staying on the surface in the refugee center maybe, I "
"don't think they were part of most of the original discussions about the "
"ranch."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll keep an eye out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You've done a lot for the ranch, by generally helping the community with both "
"wellness and trade.  As the project lead, I want to make sure these efforts "
"don't go unnoticed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You mean setting up the doctor's office?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Is this about bootstrapping the trade relating to the bar?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Understood.  Back to business."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Ever since you got the bartender set up, our liquor business has been running "
"so much better!  As thanks for your efforts, I wanted to reward you with a "
"portion of recent profits."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I heard you helped jumpstart our local medical services.  With that basic "
"need covered, everyone has been able to focus on their work a lot more, so to "
"thank you for your efforts, I wanted to reward you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Cut 200 planks"
msgstr "Nařež 200 prken"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cut 200 planks"
msgid ""
"Our first project is to enclose the barn so that new refugees have a safe "
"place to sleep.  Before we can begin serious improvements, we need lumber to "
"work with.  Enclosing the four barn entrances will take nearly 400 planks… if "
"you could provide half of that, we should be able to take care of the other "
"half and construction.  If you don't have a truck, I'd make finding one your "
"first priority."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cut 200 planks"
msgid "The more men we can bring to the camp, the quicker improvements can be made."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cut 200 planks"
msgid "Avoid destroying the furniture, we'll be needing it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cut 200 planks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Blankets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2500 Nails"
msgid "Do you have them?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cut 200 planks"
msgid ""
"Great, I'll send word that we could use another set of hands or two to help "
"out here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find 25 Blankets"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Blankets"
msgid ""
"With the barn entrances enclosed, the refugees moving in there should feel "
"safer, but the weather can be bitter here.  We're going to need to build "
"makeshift beds in the stalls to ward off disease and frostbite.  We can take "
"care of the frames, but will need your help looting blankets.  We'd need 25 "
"blankets to provide the most basic sleeping accommodations."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Blankets"
msgid ""
"I'd start with looting hotels or you could sew them together… but that would "
"be a last resort."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Blankets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2500 Nails"
msgid "Avoid destroying the furniture here, we'll be needing it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Blankets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2500 Nails"
msgid "Your assistance is always appreciated."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather 2500 Nails"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2500 Nails"
msgid ""
"Our supply of nails has been depleted.  I'm going to have to ask you to get "
"us a few more boxes.  Hardware stores should have a few if they haven't been "
"looted.  I suppose you may be able to find handfuls of them in building "
"rubble.  We'd need 2500 to have enough that we won't be sending you back out "
"too soon."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2500 Nails"
msgid ""
"Deconstructing furniture isn't going to be efficient, try looking for boxes "
"or grabbing any sitting on top of rubble piles."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather 30lb (3888 units) of Salt"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30lb (3888 units) of Salt"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you've noticed the new workers that have started trickling in.  The "
"Free Merchant counsel is demanding that we immediately begin projects to "
"become self-sufficient due to limited supplies.  We are going to need to "
"rapidly setup an agricultural industry before winter and starvation catches "
"us unprepared and unsupported.  In order to get a half dozen shovels and a "
"couple of bags of seeds, we are going to have to trade for it.  I've already "
"got the deal lined up, but the only thing they are willing to trade it for is "
"salt.  I negotiated them down from 50 lbs to 30… we were hoping you might "
"have access to a source."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30lb (3888 units) of Salt"
msgid ""
"Salt is key to preserving meat and other perishables… without any excess food "
"it wouldn't do us much good now, but I imagine we'll need to send you out to "
"get more in the future."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30lb (3888 units) of Salt"
msgid ""
"If you can find a source of salt water you should be able to boil it down.  "
"Alternatively, you can go into the cities and search restaurants."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30lb (3888 units) of Salt"
msgid "Do you have the salt?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30lb (3888 units) of Salt"
msgid "We are going to begin preparing our fields immediately."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather 30 Bottles (120 units) of Liquid Fertilizer"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30 Bottles (120 units) of Liquid
#. Fertilizer"
msgid ""
"Well, our first crop will be planted shortly, but I'm starting to suspect "
"that our profit margin is going to be much smaller than we expect.  With "
"limited seed for our original crop, our next course of action is to increase "
"the soil's fertility.  Is there any way you could find or produce a basic "
"liquid fertilizer for us?  We'd need at least 120 units or 30 full bottles to "
"make a significant improvement in our output."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30 Bottles (120 units) of Liquid
#. Fertilizer"
msgid ""
"I don't know the exact recipe, but I'm sure you could make it from a "
"commercial fertilizer or produce it from bonemeal."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30 Bottles (120 units) of Liquid
#. Fertilizer"
msgid "I'd look through a few basic chemistry books to find a simple recipe."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30 Bottles (120 units) of Liquid
#. Fertilizer"
msgid "Do you have the liquid fertilizer?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30 Bottles (120 units) of Liquid
#. Fertilizer"
msgid "This really should make the first winter easier to survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather 75 Rocks"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 75 Rocks"
msgid ""
"Our current assessment for survivability has increased significantly thanks "
"to your efforts.  The next priority issue is securing a cleaner water source. "
" Drinking from the pond on the back end of the ranch has led to an outbreak "
"of dysentery.  We need to improve the sanitary conditions in the camp as "
"quickly as possible.  To do so, the first step is to dig a well and construct "
"stone fireplaces in the barn for the migrants to boil water.  We are going to "
"need at least 75 rocks from you if we hope to accomplish the task before we "
"all get sick.  After we have them installed, you will have free access to "
"them, guaranteed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 75 Rocks"
msgid ""
"If you take a shovel to a pile of rubble, you should be able to pull out "
"structural grade rocks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 75 Rocks"
msgid "Do you have the rocks?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 75 Rocks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 Pipes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2 Electric Motors"
msgid "I appreciate the work you do."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather 50 Pipes"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 Pipes"
msgid ""
"To fabricate the well's hand pump and construct components for several other "
"projects, we are going to need to find or fabricate a number of steel pipes.  "
"Plumbing is a distant possibility for now, but some form of irrigation will "
"eventually become desirable.  You could assist us with procuring 50 steel "
"pipes, if you so have the chance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 Pipes"
msgid ""
"Hopefully we will be able to assign new migrants to help fulfill our needs in "
"the future."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 Pipes"
msgid ""
"Pipes are used in numerous metal constructions.  Smashing abandoned furniture "
"may provide the material we need."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 Pipes"
msgid "Do you have the pipes?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather 2 Electric Motors"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2 Electric Motors"
msgid ""
"With the well's completion, we are rapidly closing the sustainability gap.  "
"In order to expand from here, we will need massive quantities of lumber to "
"construct fortifications and new buildings.  We have already begun work on a "
"manually operated sawmill, but we will need two electric motors to control "
"the actual blades.  We were hoping you might be able to secure the motors for "
"us."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2 Electric Motors"
msgid ""
"Power for the motors will be provided by a salvaged truck battery, you need "
"not bring additional mechanical components."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2 Electric Motors"
msgid ""
"A car dealership or a golf course might have some electric vehicles to get "
"one from.  Otherwise there's probably something broken down along the road."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2 Electric Motors"
msgid "Do you have the motors?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather 150 Units of Bleach"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 150 Units of Bleach"
msgid ""
"Disease and infection remains a persistent problem among the refugees.  "
"Without dedicated medical personnel and facilities, I doubt everyone will be "
"willing to stick around when the next outbreak happens.  Until we can get a "
"former medic or nurse, I'm just going to have to improvise.  Sterilization "
"would be the first step I imagine.  Bring me 150 units of bleach so we can "
"get started."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 150 Units of Bleach"
msgid "I'm sure you can find bleach in most homes…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 150 Units of Bleach"
msgid ""
"If you can't find a large supply I'd recommend checking hospitals or research "
"labs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 150 Units of Bleach"
msgid "Do you have the bleach?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather 36 bandages"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 36 bandages"
msgid ""
"We've started planning a medical clinic, but we are going to need a lot more "
"supplies if we hope to warrant sending one of the few people with medical "
"experience from the refugee center to our outpost.  I know first aid "
"equipment is rare, but they have all the basic supplies that I'm uncertain "
"of.  If you could bring in thirty-six bandages I'm sure we could supplement "
"them to make theirs last a bit longer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 36 bandages"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 6 bottles (60 units) of antiseptic"
msgid "We'll do our best to make them last…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 36 bandages"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 6 bottles (60 units) of antiseptic"
msgid "Homes, hospitals, labs, and doctor offices would be where I'd check."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 36 bandages"
msgid "Do you have the bandages?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather 6 bottles (60 units) of antiseptic"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 6 bottles (60 units) of antiseptic"
msgid ""
"We've started planning a medical clinic, but we are going to need a lot more "
"supplies if we hope to warrant sending one of the few people with medical "
"experience from the refugee center to our outpost.  I know first aid "
"equipment is rare, but they have all the basic supplies that I'm uncertain "
"of.  If you could bring in 6 bottles of antiseptic, I'm sure we could "
"supplement them to make theirs last a bit longer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 6 bottles (60 units) of antiseptic"
msgid "Do you have the antiseptic?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find 2 Arc Welders"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Arc Welders"
msgid ""
"The work you have done has swayed the leaders at the refugee center to send "
"someone out to assist with our medical needs.  The next step is for us to get "
"a sort of chop-shop setup so that we can begin using scrap metal to build "
"fortifications and equipment.  We are going to need a pair of arc welders for "
"our mechanics to use."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Arc Welders"
msgid "With two, we should be able to repair one if it breaks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Arc Welders"
msgid ""
"The only place I've seen them is garages, but I imagine you could find them "
"in some stores."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Arc Welders"
msgid "Do you have the welders?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find 12 Car Batteries"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 Car Batteries"
msgid ""
"We have the basic equipment that we need, but without a functioning power "
"grid, we are forced to rely on the readily available vehicle batteries.  This "
"is going to be a chore, but I'll need twelve car batteries to swap between "
"charging and powering our equipment.  The good news is that they don't need "
"to be charged; we can take care of that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 Car Batteries"
msgid ""
"Cars can be found in traffic jams along roads or in parking lots… I'm sure "
"you can find a few."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 Car Batteries"
msgid "Do you have the car batteries?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 Car Batteries"
msgid "I'm impressed with your abilities."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find 2 Two-Way Radios"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Two-Way Radios"
msgid ""
"Check with the nurse when you get a chance; I know she will need help setting "
"up our clinic.  On the construction front, we are going to need to get "
"dedicated scavenger teams setup to bring in the miscellaneous supplies that "
"we use in small quantities.  We are going to start setting up a junk shop for "
"them behind the sawmill, so we could use your help with that.  Communication "
"is the biggest obstacle for the teams… could you bring in a pair of two-way "
"radios?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Two-Way Radios"
msgid "Organizing the scavenging missions is difficult enough without communication."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Two-Way Radios"
msgid "You should be able to find them in electronics stores or at a police station."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Two-Way Radios"
msgid "Do you have the two-way radios?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Two-Way Radios"
msgid "I'm sure the scavengers will find these useful."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather 5 Backpacks"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 5 Backpacks"
msgid ""
"The volunteers for the scavenging teams will need to be issued some basic "
"equipment.  When the boss sets up shop in the junk shed, you should ask him "
"what else he needs for his teams.  In the meantime, we can provide a few "
"backpacks to get them started.  Could you find five backpacks to give to the "
"initial team?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 5 Backpacks"
msgid "It may be easier to make them if you can't find a school or something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 5 Backpacks"
msgid "Do you have the backpacks?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 5 Backpacks"
msgid "Having at least basic equipment greatly increases survivability.  Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find a copy of Homebrewer's Bible"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of Homebrewer's Bible"
msgid ""
"Growth has lately begun to stall.  We have individuals passing through the "
"outpost, but the prospect of hard labor just to eke out an existence is "
"driving them away.  We've asked around and decided that, despite our pressing "
"needs, building a bar ought to draw some of the less committed individuals to "
"the outpost.  Unlike other settlements, the more hands we have, the more food "
"we can produce… at least in the long term.  Unfortunately, no one here has "
"brewed alcoholic drinks before, so we are going to need you to find a book "
"called the 'Homebrewer's Bible' or something along those lines."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of Homebrewer's Bible"
msgid "I guess you should search homes or libraries?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of Homebrewer's Bible"
msgid "I guarantee we will toast to your name when the bar is finished."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Gather 80lb (10000 units) of Sugar"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 80lb (10000 units) of Sugar"
msgid ""
"Just flipping through the book, I can tell that one ingredient in most of the "
"alcoholic drinks that we don't have a large supply of is sugar.  What alcohol "
"we have been able to loot isn't going to last us long, so starting our first "
"large batch is a priority.  Could you bring in 80 lbs of sugar?  That should "
"last us until we can start producing our own supply."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 80lb (10000 units) of Sugar"
msgid ""
"You might get lucky finding it, but you could always boil it out of fruit if "
"you are familiar with the process.  Or go into the cities and look in "
"restaurants and bakeries."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 80lb (10000 units) of Sugar"
msgid "Do you have the sugar?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 80lb (10000 units) of Sugar"
msgid ""
"There is a large group of thirsty individuals in our outpost that are truly "
"thankful for your work."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Collect 30 Glass Sheets"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 30 Glass Sheets"
msgid ""
"Although we are an agricultural outpost, we are restricted to growing plants "
"that are compatible with the New England climate during the warmer months.  "
"The easiest way to work around that is to build greenhouses to supplement our "
"external fields.  There isn't going to be an easy way to build these.  We are "
"going to need a massive number of glass sheets to enclose the frames.  The "
"first house will need 30 sheets of glass if you are still interested."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 30 Glass Sheets"
msgid ""
"Deconstructing existing windows is the only way I know of to keep the sheets "
"intact."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 30 Glass Sheets"
msgid "Do you have the glass sheets?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 30 Glass Sheets"
msgid "We'll begin planting our first seeds as soon as we can get these installed."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Unfortunately, I don't have anything that can help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I don't know what I could offer."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Afraid not.  Maybe somebody else could help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Maybe the scrapper would have some spare parts?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ Mission source for clinic.  Provides medical attention.
msgid "Nurse"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I was a practicing nurse, so I've taken over the medical responsibilities of "
"the outpost till we can locate a physician."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm willing to pay a premium for medical supplies that you might be able to "
"scavenge up.  I also have a few miscellaneous jobs from time to time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What kind of jobs do you have for me?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Not now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I can take a look at you or your companions if you have any small injuries.  "
"Anything more than some bleeding and you'll need to get a doctor to take a "
"look."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[40 merch, 15m] I need you to patch me up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[100 merch, 30m] I need you to patch my friends up."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "That's the best I can do on short notice."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Collect 100 Aspirin"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
msgid ""
"I've got a handful of bandages and a few first aid kits to work with at the "
"moment… in other words I'm completely unable to treat most serious medical "
"emergencies.  I'm supposed to have priority on any medical supplies that the "
"scavengers bring in, but I imagine the black market for the stuff will "
"prevent me from ever seeing it.  I could use your help getting me 100 aspirin "
"pills to start with."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
msgid "Aspirin is pretty common in homes and convenience stores."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
msgid "Do you have the aspirin?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
msgid "We'll go through this pretty quickly, but it does help."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Collect 3 Hotplates"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
msgid ""
"I was given a few bottles of bleach when I arrived, but I need a number of "
"hotplates to actually sterilize equipment.  I'm sure you can find them in any "
"old house or appliance store.  Three should be enough for now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
msgid "It should be a fairly common item.  Don't know what else to say."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
msgid "Do you have the hotplates?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
msgid ""
"Disease is spreading rapidly due to poor nutrition and there is little that I "
"can do about it.  With food being scarce, people are willing to survive on "
"whatever they can.  I need to start supplementing the outpost's diet with "
"vitamins to prevent potential deaths indirectly attributable to nutrition.  I "
"know it is a lot, but if you could bring me 200 multivitamin pills, I'd be "
"able to treat the most vulnerable before they spread anything to the rest of "
"us."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
msgid "Do you have the vitamins?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
msgid ""
"Despite my recommendations, we continue to have travelers come in with "
"illnesses that I've been able to trace back to contaminated drinking water.  "
"When boiling water isn't an option, they need some form of charcoal water "
"filter that they can use.  If you could build me four charcoal water filters, "
"I'll distribute them to groups as they pass through."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
msgid ""
"With some basic survival and crafting skills, you should be able to make them "
"with little effort."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
msgid "Do you have the charcoal water filters?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find a Chemistry Set"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
msgid ""
"I've been working on producing some of our own medical supplies, but I'm "
"going to need a chemistry set to get everything that I need in order.  Is "
"there any way you could go through one of the school chemistry labs and steal "
"me a chemistry set?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
msgid "You might be able to find one in a pharmacy if you can't find a school."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
msgid "Do you have the chemistry set?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find 10 Filter Masks"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
msgid ""
"The number of airway infections that I've encountered in the past week has "
"depleted my supply of masks.  Could you find me 10 filter masks?  I tend to "
"only distribute them in severe cases, so I'll be sure to make them last."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
msgid "You may be able to make one if you had the right guide."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
msgid "Do you have the filter masks?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
msgid ""
"The bodily fluids that I often have to clean up and the caustic chemicals I "
"deal with have done a number on my current pair of gloves.  Could you find me "
"four pairs of heavy rubber gloves?  That should be enough that I can task a "
"few laborers with cleanup details in the event of an outbreak."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
msgid "You should be able to find them in cleaning closets."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
msgid "Do you have the rubber gloves?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find 2 Scalpels"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
msgid ""
"I heard that we may have a physician on his way here.  The workers have "
"already begun expanding the clinic, but I need you to locate a pair of "
"scalpels to use in surgery when he arrives.  I'm sure you should be able to "
"find them in a hospital or craft shop."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
msgid "Hospitals and crafting stores should have a few."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
msgid "Do you have the scalpels?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
msgid ""
"Have you heard of a book called the 'Guide to Advanced Emergency Care?'  I "
"really need a copy.  The doctor is requesting a lot of supplies that I'm not "
"familiar with, but I believe I could make if I could get a copy of the book."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
msgid "Libraries are the only place I'd think to look."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
msgid "Do you have the Guide to Advanced Emergency Care?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Find 10 Syringes"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
msgid ""
"We are starting to isolate a few natural antibiotic serums, but we don't have "
"the supplies to administer the cocktails.  I need you to bring me 10 empty "
"syringes to use.  I'll take care of cleaning them to prevent transferring "
"infections."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
msgid "Do you have the empty syringes?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Mission source, shopkeep
msgid "Scavenger Boss"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Welcome to the junk shop."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Let's see what you've managed to find."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any lucky find?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Nope, current run hasn't returned yet.  Come back in <interval>.  You might "
"find something you like."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Alright, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Are you interested in the scavenging runs or one of the other tasks that I "
"might have for you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Tell me more about the scavenging runs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What kind of tasks do you have for me?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "No, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We don't have any of the parts needed right now, but we could send out a "
"scavenging party to a hospital if you have anyone willing to go."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Make 12 Simple Knife Spears"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Simple Knife Spears"
msgid ""
"I can usually use additional survival gear to kit out the new recruits.  The "
"most basic weapon that everyone gets is the simple knife spear… it provides a "
"good mix of range, power, and ease of use when engaging the more common "
"monsters.  Could you make me a dozen of them?  I may need more later, but "
"that should help the first few teams."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Simple Knife Spears"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
msgid "You should be able to make them with the most basic of skills."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Simple Knife Spears"
msgid "Do you have the simple knife spears?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Make 5 Headlamps"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
msgid ""
"Night is the ideal time for my team to go on raids, but they are going to "
"need better light sources to speed up their missions.  Could you craft a set "
"of five headlamps for them?  Keeping both hands free greatly helps during "
"combat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
msgid "Do you have the headlamps?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Make 3 Leather Body Armor"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Leather Body Armor"
msgid ""
"Clothing that can withstand the wear and tear of climbing through windows and "
"fighting back wild animals is in high demand.  The best that we have been "
"able to find is leather body armor, but it is difficult to make with our "
"limited resources.  Could you craft us three pairs of leather body armor?  "
"The life expectancy of my scavengers would drastically increase if you did."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Leather Body Armor"
msgid "Finding the leather might be easier in town rather than making it yourself."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Leather Body Armor"
msgid "Do you have the leather body armors?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
msgid ""
"When outnumbered or forced to pull back, my scavengers have been taught to "
"throw Molotov cocktails to keep monsters from chasing them.  We go through "
"one or two on every mission, so we can always use a few more.  Would you be "
"willing to make us a dozen?  I'm willing to pay you what I can for your "
"assistance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
msgid ""
"Alcohol or kerosene is probably easier to refine rather than find in large "
"quantities."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
msgid "Do you have the Molotov cocktails?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data/json/overmap/overmap_special/specials.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Flavor
#. ~ Name of NPC faction camp
msgid "Scrapper"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Don't mind me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I chop up useless vehicles for spare parts and raw materials.  If we can't "
"use a vehicle immediately, we haul it into the ring we are building to "
"surround the outpost.  It provides a measure of defense in the event that we "
"get attacked."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I don't personally, the teams we send out to recover the vehicles usually "
"need a hand, but can be hard to catch since they spend most of their time "
"outside the outpost."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "An angle grinder and a hacksaw?  I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Tools for Scrap"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Tools for Scrap"
msgid ""
"The scrapper is willing to part with some scrap to help build an anesthetic "
"machine in exchange for an angle grinder and a hacksaw."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Tools for Scrap"
msgid "Have you found the tools yet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Tools for Scrap"
msgid ""
"These will be very useful, thanks!  I found the parts that you needed and can "
"work with the doctor to build the equipment whenever they are ready."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Flavor
msgid "Laborer"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Please leave me alone…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That's sad."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Uhm."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "What could I possibly have that could help?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You need something?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The rate is a bit steep, but I still have my quotas that I need to fulfill.  "
"The logs will be dropped off in the garage at the entrance to the camp.  I'll "
"need a bit of time before I can deliver another load."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[800 merch, 1d] 10 logs"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "<npc_name> drops the logs off in the garage…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[4800 merch, 7d] 100 logs"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "<end_talking_later> <end_talking_bye>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Flavor
msgid "Woodworker"
msgstr "Dřevař"

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Don't have much time to talk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I turn the logs that laborers bring in into lumber to expand the outpost.  "
"Maintaining the saw is a chore, but breaks the monotony."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Bringing in logs is one of the few tasks we can give to the unskilled, so I'd "
"be hurting them if I outsourced it.  Ask around though, I'm sure most people "
"could use a hand."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/mission_mapgen_tacoma_commune.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/overmap_terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/overmap_terrain.json
#. ~ Signage placed on map
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
msgid "Clinic"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/mission_mapgen_tacoma_commune.json
#. ~ Signage placed on map
msgid "Extra Supplies.  Take what you need."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/mission_mapgen_tacoma_commune.json
#. ~ Signage placed on map
msgid "Scavenger Storage.  Stay out!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/mission_mapgen_tacoma_commune.json
#. ~ Signage placed on map
msgid ""
"Your name is crudely scribbled on the sign with 'Not for commune use' below "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Dana is a young woman who survived with her husband, but she was pregnant
#. and lost the baby.  This class def is for after she moves to Tacoma.
msgid "baker"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hi Dana, how are things here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Got any bread for sale?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hello, Dana!  What's with the trailer?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hey, Pablo!  Dana said you had some plans to build a bakery?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Nice to see you Dana, I'm just checking in."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Not bad.  Much better than before.  Pablo and I have privacy, and the folks "
"here actually appreciate my bread instead of paying me a pittance for it and "
"then taking it to the basement without so much as a 'thanks'."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What's with the trailer?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any luck with the pregnancy?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Ha, this thing!\"  She dusts the flour off her hands and tucks a loose lock "
"of hair back behind her ear.  \"You remember, we signed on as caravan hands "
"to get us out here.  Well, we had a bunch of stops along the way first.  We "
"were headed to a little group of survivors that snagged themselves a huge "
"stock of dry food somehow, and passed this trailer sales yard smack dab in "
"the middle of nowhere, nobody to be seen for miles.  Pablo managed to sweet "
"talk the group into taking a rest stop there.  We searched the yard, and a "
"lot of the stuff wasn't suitable, but this baby was ready to go.  Long story "
"short, we got the keys to that vintage truck outside, hitched this thing up, "
"and upgraded our caravan.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How did you get the keys to the truck?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What made this trailer so good?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*turns serious.  \"We went inside the dealership to see if they were there.  "
"Owner was still in there.  I… I think he took his own life, maybe figured "
"destroying the brain would keep him from reviving.  It… it didn't.  The "
"shotgun took out enough though, he couldn't, uh, he couldn't really see.  "
"Just this miserable, half-faced… we put him down.  I think we did him a "
"favor, if there was any of him left in there.  Didn't feel wrong going "
"through his pockets.  Gross, but not wrong.\"  She blows out a stream of air, "
"sending a small cloud of flour rising in the air, then shrugs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It's all propane!\"  She grins.  \"The oven, especially.  We don't need "
"electric, which means we don't need to run the gennie and attract attention.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Seems like a tiny kitchen for a bakery."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Won't you run out of propane?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*sighs and nods.  \"Making do with what I've got, but yeah.  I can only crank "
"out a couple loaves a day, and can't do anything fun.  Pablo has been talking "
"about setting me up a separate kitchen to really get going, but we've got so "
"much critical work to do, and fresh bread is a luxury, even if it's great for "
"morale.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You bet we will.  We've been collecting tanks and have enough for a while, "
"but I'm burning through it faster than the scavengers can bring in more.  "
"Pablo is working out some plans with the others to get me a real wood fired "
"kitchen soon, and that'll also boost my capacity.  Maybe he could give you "
"some scavenging work if you ask."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Dana_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*shrugs.  \"We got our hands on a few boxes of test strips so that's good.  "
"Being stressed isn't good for conception and I've been pretty fuckin' "
"stressed for a while.  I like our chances a lot better now, that's for sure.  "
"And, well, we've got our own private space at least.\"  She smirks and then "
"blushes slightly, hiding it by fiddling with her baking project."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
msgid "bookkeeper"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Pablo is a young professional who survived with his wife, but she was
#. pregnant and lost the baby.
msgid "Bookkeeper"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*looks up at you from a ledger, takes a moment to place you, then smiles "
"broadly.  \"Great to see you, my friend.  To what do I owe the pleasure?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hi, Pablo!  How are things going here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hello, Pablo!  What's with the trailer?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hey, Pablo!  I heard you might be willing to trade for propane?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Just popping in to say hi.  Talk to you later!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Can't complain,\" he stretches his neck and pops his shoulder.  \"No, really, "
"I can't.  The work is hard, but people here really want to *do* something, "
"not just hide inside and hope someone saves us.  I've been helping doing "
"general labor a bit, but also working out an inventory system for our "
"supplies.  It's already helped us get a few important bits in earlier than "
"we'd have noticed otherwise.  Post-apocalyptic accounting, ha!  Who'd have "
"thought?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Keeping inventory is similar to accounting?  Really?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"If you want the honest truth, only a bit.  It's not much like filing income "
"tax.  Still, I know my way around a spreadsheet and I don't mind staring at "
"numbers all day.  I think people were dubious at first, but now that it's "
"starting to show real value they're coming around.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Oh, Dana tells that story better than me.  Basically we found it at an old "
"trailer park and she liked the bakery, so we figured out a way to get it back "
"here.  We definitely earned some cred for coming with our own shelter."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Yeah, she would say that.\"  He makes intense eye contact.  \"Not just a "
"bakery, my friend.  A real, post apocalyptic, honest-to-god culinary "
"experience!  We're planning to grow food and crops here.  Central's plan is "
"to import our crops directly, and pay us for our work.  I don't think they've "
"even thought much about transport, outside just shipping them back home.  If "
"we do local site processing we can prevent storage losses, and make higher "
"value material to sell out!  And Central still benefits from having a "
"dedicated bread basket!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you know anything about building a 'culinary experience'?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm being a bit tongue-in-cheek there.  Really I want some big wood fired "
"ovens, tools for milling grain, tinning and canning equipment, stuff like "
"that.  We'll make flour, jam, pickles, bread, maybe some sauerkraut and "
"things.  All the old school ways of preserving food, from before fridges were "
"commonplace."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Okay, but do you know anything about that?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well…\" he tugs jokingly at his collar as though letting off steam.  \"I know "
"a bit.  I used to make pickles and jams as a hobby.  With my mom.  When I was "
"a teenager.  But I know the principles!  And Dana knows more than you'd think "
"about grain and flour because she's a huge nerd for her craft.  We do have "
"some knowledge gaps between design and implementation though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What kind of gaps?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Not where you might think.\"  He sets aside his ledger and pulls out a page "
"of bullet-point notes written in neat block letters.  \"Everyone is on board "
"with the idea and the amount of actual building to get it online is small "
"enough that the carpenters are willing to help out, so I don't need any "
"assistance with design.  For the really short term I basically just need "
"materials.  I've been collecting spare wood, but to get a good wood-fired "
"oven I need to secure a source of firebrick.  In the longer run, Dana knows "
"the principles of milling, but I need a resource book if I want to set up a "
"functioning mill, first a muscle-powered one and then a windmill for long "
"term.  I wish I'd thought of asking Jenny.  She's a mechanical engineer, but "
"she would probably know how to get me started at least.  I'm also still "
"looking into how to make a good vermin-proof cellar.  Longer term, I will "
"need to work my way around our reliance on sugar, salt, and vinegar from "
"before the Cataclysm, but our stocks of those will hold out for months while "
"I sort things out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "No problem.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well, I'd better go look into that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I… I honestly don't know why I didn't think of that.  I could even have asked "
"the supply caravans to do it.  If it comes down to it though, I trust you "
"more than them.  Would you mind?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sure.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sure, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Oh… oh, ok!  It's a good thing you showed me this, my basic guesses missed "
"some important points.  Thanks, this will be helpful for a lot more than just "
"the bakery."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any time!  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I heard you might be willing to trade for propane?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Dana said you had some plans to build a bakery?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I don't mind keeping my eye out for some firebricks for you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I can pass a note to Jenny about helping with the mill designs, if you want."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"[Survival 4, Fabrication 4] I know how to build a good root cellar.  Here, "
"let me show you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Get Pablo some fire bricks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get Pablo some fire bricks."
msgid "Find some fire bricks to help Pablo build an oven."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Pass a message to Jenny Forcette."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/Nunez/NPC_Pablo_Tacoma.json
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pass a message to Jenny Forcette."
msgid "Ask Jenny Forcette if she can help Pablo Nunez with his mill designs."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Any time, what's on your mind?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like your opinion on a job we're doing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Raise your hand for a high-five.]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can I ask you a bit about yourself?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You picked up a lot of useful skills over the years, hey."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I just wanted to chat, you know.  To relax."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"The way you said something earlier made me realize… you have a crush on Jenny "
"Forcette, don't you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "*high fives you back enthusiastically."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "*returns the high five with a flourish"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "*leaps into the air and gives you a spinning high five."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "*smacks your hand with a resounding clap."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "*pretends to fake you out for a moment, then grins and returns the high five"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Nod and continue talking.]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Nod and head on out.]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Sure.  Can I tell you about this idea I had for a comic I'm never gonna make?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Lately I've been thinking about my Steam library and all those games I was "
"putting off for a bad time.  Now it's a bad time and I can't play 'em.  "
"Tragedy of our era, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You remember that girl from high school I had that huge crush on?  Emily?  I "
"wonder if she's still alive.  I shoulda asked her out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Aw dude.  I was just remembering about this crowdfunded board game I backed "
"right before things went to hell.  It'd be fulfilling right about now, I bet."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Does it ever seem to you like the stars are in different places from where "
"they used to be?  I can find all the old constellations, but they look "
"different now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Since everything went down, I keep having this recurring dream where I'm at "
"Foodplace again, and Luke Skywalker is there, demanding an EB2 combo with "
"extra Beverage, and he's being a real Karen about it.  Do you think it means "
"something?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Maybe it's weird but this whole thing sorta feels like an extended camping "
"trip.  With zombies."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I slept weird last night.  Got this awful crick in my neck."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Do you think the internet is still out there somewhere, floating around in "
"some still-functional servers somehow?  It's weird to think about what "
"happened to all that data."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Remember that guy Daren in elementary who used to tell all those weird-ass "
"creepy stories?  Chris hated him but I thought he was interesting.  I wonder "
"if he's alive, he'd have loved this."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You know what I could really use right now?  A hot bath."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Next time we hit a library, I'm gonna see if they've got a copy of Gideon the "
"Ninth.  I read that book a while ago, but I was super high and I don't "
"remember much of it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Do you remember what day of the week it is?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Next time I get a chance, I'm gonna make a nice big bowl of mac and cheese."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Y'know, these shoes are surprisingly comfy.  You wouldn't think it to look at "
"'em."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Do you think zombies know what's going on?  Like, are the original people "
"still in there watching all this happen?  I sure hope not."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It's funny how fast all this weird shit starts to feel normal, don't you "
"think?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "We're always gonna be friends, right?  Even with the apocalypse… changing us?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you miss most about the internet?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Now that we've got no responsibilities, is there anything you'd like to see "
"or do?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you think the rest of the world is like these days?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you miss any food from the old days?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "<talk_snippet_modded_liam_Friends4ever>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Aww, of course.  No matter what happens, you're always you and I'm always me, "
"right?  We've been through worse than this.\"  He pauses, his brow furrowed.  "
"\"Well, okay, maybe we haven't.  But we've stuck through it all for so many "
"years, what's a little apocalypse gonna change?  Or a little mutation, or "
"grievous bodily harm, or zombies, or interdimensional monster attacks and "
"serious life-altering PTSD, or whatever.  Who cares.  You're my family, more "
"than my birth family ever was."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Continue chatting.]"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"OK, I know you're leading me up to say something dirty, and yeah I miss that, "
"but you know what?  Really the thing I miss most is social media.  No "
"seriously!  Stop looking at me like that!  I liked being able to just talk to "
"people no matter where they were, any time.  I had friends in Sweden, and "
"Brazil, and the West Coast.  I'm never gonna know what happened to them, and "
"that busts me up bad.  They mattered to me, you know?\"  His voice catches a "
"bit, and he coughs.  \"You're here though, and that helps a lot.  Can't "
"imagine trying to do this lone-wolf.  How about you, what were you thinking "
"of when you asked?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well, I mean, there's the obvious stuff like, uh, video streaming,\" he winks "
"at you, \"but I think lately I'm missing Wikipedia.  I have all these random "
"questions about things, and I can't answer them.  I feel like I'm living in a "
"box.  How did we survive for thousands of years like this?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Online restaurant reviews.\"  He stares at you without a shred of irony.  "
"\"I'm serious, I used to love browsing looking for the funniest or weirdest "
"reviews.  I guess I could broaden it, I miss pointless doom scrolling.  It's "
"harder to find things to keep my mind off things now, and I've got more I "
"wish I could keep my mind off.  What about you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"You know me, I was never high on the ambition front.  Honestly, "
"if you weren't around I'd probably clean up my dad's old cabin, try to learn "
"how to set up a power supply, and scavenge for parts until I'd built the best "
"damn gaming rig the world will ever see.  Then I'd load up whatever games I "
"could find.\"  He pauses.  \"Or maybe it'd be easier to set up a console, I "
"dunno.  Most consoles aren't gonna like the no-internet thing right?  There's "
"probably a way to crack 'em but without the internet where would we even "
"check?\"  He rubs his chin.  \"Still.  I'd have maybe found a way.  How about "
"you, what's the big overarching plan for all this?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Oh, well.  I don't really think of life that way, you know?  I guess I'm "
"pretty happy to just hang out with you, doing the shit we're doing, seeing "
"what life brings.  Still, I guess I could see settling down somewhere nice, "
"somewhere quiet, somewhere zombie-free.  I bet it wouldn't take long to get "
"enough food and supplies to live on forever, and then I'd just let myself "
"turn into some kinda wild bush man, with a big crazy long beard.  I'd smell "
"like weed and B.O. and I'd have this giant stack of books to read.  Other "
"survivors would come find me, like a guru on a mountaintop, to ask me "
"questions about Batman.  In time, as the old world was forgotten, I'd "
"convince them that he was a real person.\"  He grins.  \"How 'bout you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Oh dude, good question.  The news reports made it sound like this is "
"everywhere, you know?  Still, somewhere out there's gotta be better than "
"this, right?  Maybe like, up in the Yukon or Siberia or something it's all "
"kinda normal?  I think most places are like this though, just one big fucked "
"up mess.  Maybe they've got different monsters though, like, carnivorous "
"rocks or some shit.  How 'bout you, what do you think is out there?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"See, I like that about you.  Here we are just trying to keep alive and you're "
"thinking all these big thoughts about the rest of the world.  I got no clue "
"how they're doing out there, so I'm just gonna imagine that things are kinda "
"like here, but maybe a bit better.  There's a few places where folks have "
"settled in and they're figuring stuff out.  Those folks are gonna last a long "
"time, maybe they're how we start rebuilding."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I never thought I'd hear myself say this, but I kinda miss the Ediburger3 "
"from Foodplace.  I worked there so long, I hated everything, but as soon as "
"you tell me I'm *never* gonna have a fresh, greasy EB3 again, suddenly it's "
"all my stomach wants.  Don't try to track one down or anything though.  I'm "
"pretty sure I miss the *idea* more than the actual *thing*.  And I don't "
"think we could cook up a copy, it'd be pretty hard to get the right blend of "
"animal product and sawdust for the Meatcylinder.\"  He stares wistfully into "
"space for a moment.  \"How about you, what were you thinking of when you "
"asked?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Delivery pizza.  It's not the quality of the pizza I miss, it's the delivery. "
" Having someone just show up at the door with a god damn pizza, ready for you "
"to eat.  We lived in paradise and we knew it not.  How about you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You know, my friend, I could really go for an egg salad sandwich right now.  "
"Nice, fresh eggs, some cheap-ass white bread, bit of pickle on there, hint of "
"mustard.  Egg salad gets a bad rap because it sucks if you get it from the "
"store, but you make a good homemade one?  That's something else, I tell you.  "
"What's your poison?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You know, I'm kinda in the mood for some pub nachos right now.  The whole pub "
"ambience would be good too, but I like how they'd put 'em on wax paper that'd "
"be so soaked with cheese grease you could see right through it.  Those little "
"black olive wheels that tasted like rubber, they were only ever good with pub "
"nachos, you know?  Any other time, garbage.  I'd love to have a big tray of "
"pub nachos, go to a karaoke night, and just sing fuckin' Abba songs until my "
"throat hurt.  You in?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well, sure.  I dunno what more there is to tell, we've known each other for "
"ages."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"We hadn't caught up in a while before <the_cataclysm>.  What've you been "
"doing?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*shrugs.  \"Same as I was when we used to hang out more, mostly.  I quit my "
"job at Foodplace a while back, got tired of the stupid outfits.  Worked doing "
"labor in construction for a bit, but I didn't like my boss so I ditched it.  "
"Got a job doing deliveries for Amazon, which was absolutely shitty, but I "
"managed to jump from that to a bit of a better delivery job for a smaller "
"company.  It was actually going pretty good before everything happened.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How did you make it through the Cataclysm?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I wanna say it was a hell of a story, but really, I was on the way back to "
"Boston from a delivery and a thing about the riots came on the radio.  I was "
"close to the cabin so I just thought, 'this is starting to sound really "
"fuckin bad.'  I called in sick and took a few days to hunker down out of "
"civilization.  By the time I had to think about going back to work, we were "
"into that wild time when half the people were trying to keep things running "
"and the other half were trying to burn everything down.  I shut the blinds "
"and stayed in, until Chris showed up acting like a freak."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It doesn't feel that way, but I guess so.  I don't know if I ever told you, "
"but my dad was quite the weirdo prepper.  He built the cabin and when I was a "
"kid we'd head out and do drills for the end of the world.  It's part of why I "
"was kinda wacked out on apocalypse stuff when you and I first met, back when "
"we made the plan for where to meet up and all.  He taught me archery and some "
"survival skills but I never really took to it, partly because my ol' man was "
"a real piece of work.\"  He stares off for a minute.  \"To be honest, though, "
"now that we're in the middle of a real-ass apocalypse, I can see a lot of "
"what he taught me was just crap anyway.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What happened to your father?  You never talked about him much."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*snorts.  \"I was pretty low-contact with him the last couple years.  He got "
"me that job in construction and when I left it, he tried to hit me, found out "
"I'm not so much of a pushover as when I was fifteen.  Asshole.  I was still "
"texting my mom a bit, apparently when things went to shit, he tried to join "
"the riots.  I hope he got gunned down.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"I remember your mom as kind of a quiet lady, she seemed all right.  Should we "
"be trying to find her?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Harsh, but I hear you.  <end_talking>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well, things with her weren't as bad as with my dad, but I don't know if I'd "
"go trying to hunt for her in a zombified city or anything.  Like, sure she "
"didn't beat me up, but she didn't ever lift a finger to help me either.  She "
"was still with him right up until the end, even when it was obvious that she "
"was choosing him over me.  I don't wanna judge her for the life she led, but "
"- \" he trails off for a moment, then twitches his shoulders and resumes.  "
"\"Well, it's like I said.  I hope she's okay but I'm not gonna go risk my "
"neck trying to find her.  You and Chris were my real family, you got me "
"through those years."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*stares at you wide-eyed for a beat, then breaks into a shy grin.  \"Aw man, "
"busted.  You *know* I dig those distracted nerdy chicks who don't react to my "
"presence in any way.  It's all good though, you know?  Don't tell her.  I "
"barely know her and it's not like she's in a place to be dating some "
"stranger.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Your secret's safe with me.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Your secret's safe with me.  <lets_go>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "My opinion?  Sure, my friend, hit me up, what's eating you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Check this out, I found an address of some kind of central refugee management "
"facility.  Should we check it out?  Maybe they'll have answers?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/xe_liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You thinking what I'm thinking about this mystery dropoff for Smokes?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any ideas about this job to clear out the back bay for Smokes?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you think about taking down this bandit camp?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any thoughts about bringing this prospectus out to the ranch?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What's the fastest way to find these guys some solar panels?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Liam, I need a lot of jars.  A shocking amount of jars."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Liam, we need bigger jars."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How about finding this guy some cigarettes?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Should we go check out those farmers the teamster mentioned?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"A secret lab in the wilds, with survivors in it, Liam.  You heard the "
"teamster."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "This 'scrap metal castle' sounds far fetched to me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What sounds better to you, a 'bullet bank' or a woman who feeds visitors?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you think about helping out this Dave guy?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"At least Dave has some practicality, and isn't just asking for more trash, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any thoughts on Dave's cardboard needs?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Looks like we might be done with cardboard for Dave, it's plastic now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I have a feeling this is the last of the cardboard for Dave."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hey, this is a different direction for Dave, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you think it's dangerous to get zombie blood, besides the obvious?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sneaking into a lab to run some data analysis can't be bad, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Who could have guessed there'd be some further complications to our stolen "
"data analysis?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you think about checking out this freezing portal lab?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"If you were tired of underground labs, now we're gonna check out secret "
"underground lab tunnels!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you know how to build a still?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"How long does brewer's yeast last in the package?  Can we just find it at a "
"supermarket?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any idea where we could find sugar beet seeds for the bartender?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you like big jugs, Liam?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How are we gonna transport two giant drums?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Bringing a professional arsonist some commercial fertilizer seems like a "
"normal thing to do."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So, uh.  Alonso's pants, hey."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you think about helping these guys clean up all that dead zombie mess?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any thoughts on finding Boris a power saw?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "We're looking for Boris' kid's old laptop.  Thoughts?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You ever used a sourdough starter?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Draco seems like a kindred spirit for you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Are you okay with tracking down a copy of the Quran?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any idea where to find a really specific reference book about pneumatic guns?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you think, where should we look for a motor for Jenny?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It shouldn't be too hard to find Jenny a big metal tank, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You ever seen gunsmithing books just lying around?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So, we're finding a book about guns for your sweet nerd-girl."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Do you think it's the right thing, trying to help the Nunez family move to "
"Tacoma?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any thoughts on helping Uyen out with her antiseptic?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any thoughts on helping Uyen out with her bandages?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any thoughts on helping Uyen out with her antidepressants?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You and me: hairdressing supply vendors now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What're your thoughts on this mission to kill bandits for the old guard?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How do you think we should track down this enemy informant?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you think about these robots?  Crazy stuff, hey?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Do you think it's really a monster hitting those trade caravans?  Any ideas "
"how we should deal with it?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So, we're officially assassins for hire now.  How do you feel about that?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well, now we're radio technicians.  Sounds fun, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"What do you make of these weird pictographs?  I think they're directions "
"somewhere."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Where do you think we can get some anesthetic for that robot guy?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any thoughts on this scouting mission, checking out this bunker thing?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"How do you think we should start looking for this lost interdimensional "
"building?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You ready to go burn some shit down?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "It's not gonna be a problem that we're hunting down Foodperson, is it?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you think about clearing out these pizzeria squatters?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So, cake and a party.  Think it was all worth it?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you think, you in the mood to hunt some slimes?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hey Liam!  Liam!  Bughunt!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Looks like I've got you doing deliveries again.  Where should we look for all "
"this lumber?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I dunno if you heard, but guess what we're gonna deliver now?  More lumber!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any idea where we can find some ropes?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "These guys need a wood saw.  You carrying one?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Where could we find a shovel?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "We're looking for a charcoal smoker now.  You seen one?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"This guy wants us to find a Remington 870 Express for a client.  You know a "
"bit about that stuff, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Nothing ever went wrong tracking down a nice old guy in a cabin in the woods, "
"right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You fine with helping this guy and his rabbits?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Does blackberry hunting sound nice?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Mind helping Mr. Lapin get in touch with his friends?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Seen an anvil around recently?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Anything we should consider before trying to find Chris Isherwood?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Looks like Barry Isherwood's got himself into some trouble."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Want to help me collect some dandelions?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hey Liam.  Bee balm?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Tonight, on 'to catch a predator'…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Eddie wants a *lot* of rocks."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So, Liam, you ready to gather sand?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I told Eddie we'd help him gather some clay."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Where should we look for jars for the Isherwoods?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any thoughts about looking for wheat seeds?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Liam, you're not afraid of the big bad wolf, are you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you think about hunting some mystery monsters for Jesse?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hey, you ever seen a book about glassblowing?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Luke Isherwood wants a copy of the DIY Compendium."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You think Barry's gonna be okay?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Liam!  There's a chef, trapped in a restaurant!  Want to help save them?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you think about tracking down these survivors camping out on a farm?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Should we go track down this mystery cabin?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Liam, I've got the location of a prepper bunker.  Should we check this out?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How do you feel about checking out a zombie-infested farm?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Sweet, road trip!  That sounds like as good a plan as any, my friend.  Gives "
"me some first season Walking Dead vibes, you know?  Maybe the place will be "
"run by sinister G-men, or a lone crazy scientist who thinks he can cure "
"zombies if he can just get his hands on one super-rare ingredient.  Road trip!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Road trip!  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm thinking this kinda sounds like that intercom and their "
"vague-yet-menacing government agency.\"  He pauses.  \"That might be a deep "
"cut, if you never listened to Night Vale.  Anyway, I bet that's where we're "
"going."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm thinking this sounds *awesome*, and also possibly we're gonna die.  At "
"least we'll die investigating a vague-yet-menacing government agency.\"  He "
"pauses.  \"That might be a deep cut, if you never listened to Night Vale."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yep, same page.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*rubs his chin thoughtfully.  \"Maybe we can set up a bottleneck in the "
"hallway?  First we drag a few lockers or something to funnel them, then one "
"of us hangs close to the barricade and the other stands back and fires arrows "
"or something?\"  He shrugs.  \"I'm not great at tactics, and I'm a bit "
"nervous about what's back there.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks man.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You sure we haven't bit off more than we can chew here?\"  He stares at you "
"for a moment.  \"This isn't DOTA2, this is real life.  These guys are gonna "
"have guns and shit.  I know we've been through a lot together but if they're "
"ready for us they could take us out before we're even close enough to see "
"them.  I mean, I'm with you if you think we can do it, but be careful, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Thanks man, I'll keep that in mind.  We gotta do this though.  Any "
"suggestions for how to do it safely?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Thanks man, I'll keep that in mind.  We'll do this carefully.  I'd like your "
"opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"If you're gonna insist on it then I say we drive up quick in the dark, take "
"cover behind the car, and make a ton of noise.  Then we take cover and when "
"they come to check things out, we pick them off.  Or maybe we come in silent, "
"from a distance, and take out their sentries.  A bow is great for that, if we "
"can make the shots.  This whole thing still seems ridiculous though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm kinda looking forward to it.  It's good to see people already building up "
"something to last, after everything that's gone down.  Wonder what we'll find "
"out there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"That's optimistic, thanks man.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You know, I read an article about how those stupid FEMA evac shelters all had "
"solar power for emergencies.  I bet nobody's looting those, let's track some "
"down and unbolt 'em."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Not a bad thought.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Look, you're the one that agreed to this.  I don't know why you keep agreeing "
"to this stuff.  Maybe we can check hardware stores?  Or just eat a lot of "
"jarred food, and keep the empties?  A hundred jars.  That's a lot, my "
"friend.\"  He shakes his head.  \"You don't have to agree to do *everything* "
"people ask you to do, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Your objection is noted.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*shakes his head at you.  \"Look, you asked last time, and I told you you "
"didn't have to keep taking jobs like this.  Now you're asking again?  *I "
"dunno, stop offering to bring a billion jars to people if you don't know "
"where to find them.*\"  He laughs.  \"I'm just messing with you.\"  His eyes "
"narrow.  \"Or am I?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"How about it?  Seems like a nice enough thing to do I guess.  I bet plenty of "
"zombies are carrying smokes, and there's probably tons in people's abandoned "
"cars."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yeah.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Isn't he just directing us out to that Isherwood farm?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Sounds good.  I'm a bit nervous about what we might find, though.  Who knows "
"what the apocalypse would do to a bunch of gun-toting back country folks?  On "
"the other hand, maybe they're sweet, salt-of-the-earth types.  Only one way "
"to find out!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Right.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Is that just that Hub place, with the intercom?  Not that it's not cool, but "
"it's nothing new to us.  Woah… we've really seen some shit, haven't we."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It sounds to me like this might be that intercom we found out in that weird "
"building?  I'm just guessing.  We should go confirm."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Hell yeah, this sounds so badass!  Let's be careful though, 'secret lab' "
"sounds like a place that's gonna have some defenses."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You bet.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "We've been there, remember?  It's got those cyborg guys, the cockney ones."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Far-fetched and awesome!  Let's go see.  Maybe it's an abandoned theme park "
"or something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "We've been there, remember"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "?  Cody, the blacksmith, she's the food lady"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"?  I'm guessing the blacksmith we didn't talk to is the one who would have "
"fed us"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ", and Jay is the one with the weird bullet bank."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ", and the other guy there must be the one with the bullet bank."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm open to anything if it means getting fed.  Ugh, unless it's unidentified "
"meat.  I guess we have to be more careful of strangers than we used to.  "
"Still, let's find out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well, I like his fashion choices, but he, um.  Well, you know.  You met him.  "
"I don't mind helping him out, in theory, but I don't know if bringing him "
"piles of trash is really going to do anyone any good.  The Merchants might "
"think it's a fire hazard."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Let's try it out anyway.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Right, I guess.  I don't quite get why you're doing this stuff for him, he's "
"probably just going to keep piling up the stuff and not doing anything with "
"it.\"  He shrugs.  \"On the other hand, maybe he'll make a kick-ass box fort, "
"I'd be all about that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That's my hope.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm telling you, this is just going to go on and on forever.\"  He looks sad. "
" \"I'd really love to see him get a cool box fort and feel better, but I "
"think we're just enabling his delusions, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Let's see this through a bit longer.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I gotta admit, this one surprised me.  I take back some of what I said "
"earlier, I'm just confused now.  Let's see where it goes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Right?  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It had better be!  I'm not sure why you're doing this, but I do think it's "
"good you're trying to help him.  Maybe we should stop eventually though?\"  "
"He sighs.  \"I don't know what to make of Dave.  I worked with a guy with "
"schizophrenia back at Foodplace, and Dave is nothing like that.  I don't know "
"if he's actually got some kind of mental illness or if it's a stress reaction "
"or something.  He doesn't act like any real person I've ever met, and we got "
"all kinds of strung-out types there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That's good insight.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well, I'm definitely interested to see where it goes.  I hope it helps Dave "
"somehow.  I don't know what's going on with him except that it's nothing like "
"any schizophrenia or anything like that I've ever seen, and I've seen "
"practically anything you can imagine, working service."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I have a good feeling.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well, it probably isn't going to come back alive.  They ooze blood "
"everywhere, when we fight 'em.  It's kinda thicker and goopier than human "
"blood, but I guess not so bad it'd be hard to draw?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This sounds *nuts* man.  How are we going to get in and out alive?  A place "
"like that is going to be crawling with zombies and who knows what else.\"  He "
"shudders.  \"Let's be careful, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Okay.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This was a total surprise to everyone,\" he grumbles.  \"Still, this can't be "
"any worse than getting the first analysis done, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Let's hope not.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&He grins.  \"I'm gonna level with you, this sounds incredibly *cool*.\"  He "
"laughs at his own joke.  \"Seriously though, it's probably going to be a "
"really tricky one"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
".  It'd be good to maybe try cybernetics to help us with the cold, they won't "
"be as bulky and confining to fight in as winter gear."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ".  We'll need to bundle up extra toasty, that'll make fighting tough."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Good thoughts.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Compared to what we've done, this doesn't sound so bad.  Creepy as heck "
"though.  We should tell ghost stories on the way."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I mean, I have a basic understanding of the principles.  We could also see if "
"we could just find a couple stills though, we're not far from the mountains.  "
"I bet every second farm's gonna have a moonshine still set up in one of the "
"sheds."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Good point, although really, how hard can it be to make one?  I'd like your "
"opinion on something else, too."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I think a supermarket might be the *yeast* likely place to find it!\"  He "
"watches your expression for a moment, then shrugs.  \"Worth a shot.  Anyway, "
"as far as I know, dry yeast lasts practically forever.  Should be able to "
"find some of it anywhere people did baking or brewing."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks, man.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Those Tacoma folks really think about sustainability, hey?  I like that.  Buy "
"local, you know?  I got no idea where to find sugar beet seeds though.  I "
"don't remember having any stocked at the cabin.  Maybe a farm or farm supply "
"store would have them?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"If we track these things down for the bartender, I hope we get a "
"nice, sincere 'tanks' at the end.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Me too.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"There's only one way for two folks like us to transport two huge liquid "
"storage drums.  We bundle ourselves in them and roll them down the hill.  "
"First one to the bar buys the other one a drink."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You know it'd be me.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Of all the jobs we've agreed to do, this is certainly one of them."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You can say that again.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I guess I get why the one Boris guy can't do it but I don't quite see why we "
"have to go around asking everyone for him.  He lives here!  Anyway, you know "
"I'm okay with getting my hands dirty, if you want to go offer to help him out "
"I'll get busy with a scrubby.  I've cleaned worse things out of the Foodplace "
"washroom.  Hell, I've cleaned worse things out of the back of my van when I "
"was running for Amazon.\"  He gets a thousand-yard-stare for a moment.  "
"\"Let's not discuss this any more."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks Liam, I knew I could count on you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It's just a fetch job, right?  I'd say our best first bet would be to see if "
"Smokes up at the Free Merchant desk has one, and just shell out to get it "
"covered.  These guys are broke as heck, but we can easily make the cash back "
"by doing some good old fashioned scavenging."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Worth checking.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&His voice comes out a bit softer and lower than usual.  \"This is just a sad "
"one, my friend.  I don't think we'll have any troubles with the delivery, but "
"it's so goddamn sad.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Nah, not me.  I hear they're hard to keep alive or something, and that makes "
"me nervous.  I was never really that much of a baker to be honest.  I love "
"the bread though, pretty excited to see what she makes.\"  He looks "
"thoughtful for a moment.  \"Depending on where the bakery is though, this "
"could be a heck of a job.  We should make sure we're ready to sneak past a "
"lot of zed to get to it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Or we could clear the area some other way.  I'd like your opinion on "
"something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*grins.  \"Yeah, he sure is.  I never got the hang of the guitar, myself, but "
"I respect the journey.  It shouldn't be too hard to find one, right?  Lots of "
"people have them in their houses, or we could maybe loot a music store if we "
"want to get fancy.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"With your singing voice, I'm glad you never learned.  I'd like your opinion "
"on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Of course!  People need what comfort they can get, right?  I've always been "
"kinda spiritual, but I'm not the sort to put a label on it or anything.  I "
"don't have a clue where to find one though, I'm not sure I'd even recognize a "
"mosque if I saw one.  Do they stock books like that in normal stores?\"  He "
"frowns.  \"I feel like I should know this, but… well, no Wikipedia, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Cell phones were something else.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing "
"though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&He scratches his head.  \"No.  I guess a library or a bookstore.  I have a "
"feeling this is going to be a tough one though.  Maybe we could try like, "
"hardware stores?  Or school libraries?\"  He thinks a bit more.  \"Those seem "
"like our best bets to me, but I'm just guessing.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks, man.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This one sounds easy to me.  Let's just take apart some old machinery until "
"we find a good one."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Kinda wonder why she didn't just get us to get her a compressor, but she "
"probably has her reasons.\"  You notice a bit of an odd tone to his voice.  "
"\"Maybe we could take apart a big compressor for her, the tank would probably "
"be perfect."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Dude.  You have a crush on Jenny."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*blushes, for some reason.  \"Uh, yeah.  Gun books, hey?  I guess we should "
"look in um, gun stores or libraries?  Or high school lockers, haha.  Oh, that "
"made me sad.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*blushes.  \"Yeah we are.\"  He smiles dopily, apparently forgetting that "
"you'd asked for his thoughts."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Any opinions on the job itself?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Just wanted to point that out.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing "
"though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Uh, right.  Maybe a gun store?  Or a library?  Or we could check high school "
"lockers, haha.  Oh, that made me sad."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You've got it *bad*, dude.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&He looks at you, a bit surprised.  \"Yeah, of course.  I mean, that "
"situation they're in now is miserable, no matter how much we've helped folks "
"out there.  Can you imagine trying to be a young couple in that cramped "
"space?\"  He waggles his eyebrows suggestively.  \"They're tryin' to have a "
"*baby*, you know.  Gonna be hard in a bunkhouse.  Let's get them out to a "
"nice farm, some fresh air, and, *you* know.\"  He winks, to drive the point "
"far, far further home than necessary.  \"Let the magic happen, right?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"That was unnecessarily clear.  Still, I'd like your opinion on a different "
"thing, somehow."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Seems pretty cut and dry to me.  Let's raid a few first aid kits.  I'm pretty "
"sure you can find that stuff in the basement of those government evac "
"shelters, for example."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Kinda don't think she needs our help on this one, but she's in a bind I "
"guess.\"  He pauses.  \"No pun intended this time,\" he chuckles.  \"Anyway, "
"let's just find some spare fabric, choppy-choppy, and Bob's your uncle.\"  He "
"thinks for a moment.  \"Actually she'll probably want them disinfected, and "
"we should find her some tape too just to be on the safe side."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Fair enough.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I admit, I haven't been paying attention to it, but I'm sure those things "
"must be around in half the medicine cabinets in the area, right?  Seems like "
"an easy looting job to me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Good point.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Worse things we could do for people than help them get haircuts,\" he shrugs. "
" \"No job too small, right?  Vanessa seems a bit cranky to me, but I'm not "
"judging.  Those folks are in a tough spot.  Maybe she'll turn suddenly nice "
"if we bring her the hair stuff she wants.\"  He grins.  \"I'm one hundred "
"percent sure that's what'll happen."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"That's my optimistic Liam.  I'd like your opinion on a different thing, "
"though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"Look, Makayla is a trained professional, she knows what she's "
"doing with several kilograms of improvised explosives, doesn't she?\"  He "
"shrugs.  \"If not, let's just stay far away when she tests it.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*blows out a long breath.  \"Well, my friend, I do think it's good to help "
"clean out some of the mess that's going on.  I'll be with you for it.  I'm "
"just not sure why you figure I'm the right guy for this job.  Shouldn't you "
"have, like, a cop or a soldier or something?  I'm a delivery driver.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Don't sell yourself short, Liam.  You've got my back."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll handle the tough parts, Liam.  You're there to cover my back, that's all."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "In troubled times, we learn what sort of people we really are."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Meh.  What's a few bandits?  We'll flatten 'em."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Thanks.  You're right.  Okay, I can do this.\"  He shakes his shoulders and "
"limbers up, like a boxer preparing for a match.  \"Let's go."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Hold up Balboa, I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Oh, oh yeah that makes sense.  Okay, well, that's something I can do.  I'll "
"cover your back like it's never been covered before.  You and me like Calvin "
"and Hobbes, baby."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks, Hooch.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*sniffs the air around your head.  \"You been getting in the ganja?  No "
"judgment if so, but maybe you shouldn't be taking mercenary jobs while you're "
"high, y'know?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Shut up, you're not my dad!  Anyway, I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*gives you some serious side-eye.  \"You okay?  This is serious shit, you're "
"making me kinda worried getting so gung-ho about it.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Don't worry, man.  Trust me, it'll be great.  Anyway, I'd like your opinion "
"on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You know, this sounds like it's gonna be some big exciting mystery whodunnit, "
"but I have this feeling if we just look around for someone who is acting "
"obviously and extremely suspicious it'll all fall apart at once."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I dunno, but compared to the last two missions for that guy, I gotta admit "
"I'm kinda stoked.  Robots?  This sounds *wicked*.  Do you think we're talking "
"more Terminator, or Wall-E?  Doesn't matter.  Robots!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Uh, well, we *did* meet that weird cyborg guy in the castle full of giant "
"robot dogs matching this exact description, right?  Tell me you remember "
"that.  Damn, it's worse saying it out loud.  I still can't really believe all "
"this stuff has really happened."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Oh, right, I remember that.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You know me my friend,\" he shrugs and grins at you.  \"I'd have said it was "
"some kinda cryptid or something *before* the world got flooded with monsters "
"and mutants.  Nowadays, I think I'd be more surprised if it was bandits "
"again.  As for how to deal with it, well, I guess we're getting pretty good "
"at dealing with this kind of thing now.  Let's handle it how we usually do: "
"with style."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Damn straight.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I dunno,\" he points to your Marshal badge.  \"I guess if they give you a "
"shiny bit of metal you're not really an assassin for hire anymore, you're the "
"law.  Judge, jury, and executioner.\"  He scratches his neck and looks away "
"for a moment.  \"You know how I feel about all these high risk missions, but "
"we've gotten this far.  It's different now than when we started out.  I don't "
"think you need my advice, you know I'll have your back whatever happens."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"I might not need it, but I still like to hear it.  I'd like your opinion on "
"something else, anyway."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Honestly my friend, this is the kinda stuff I hoped we'd be doing when we "
"offered to help these guys out.  Fresh air, great views, climbing on things "
"we'd have gotten in trouble for in the old days, maybe pushing a zombie off "
"the edge of a maintenance platform to see how big a splat it leaves at the "
"bottom.  Sounds wicked.  Let's bring a couple cold ones up to the top and "
"crack a brew while we survey the wasteland, hey?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sounds like a great idea.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm with you there, it's some kind of weird map.  The smart thing to do "
"is probably avoid it, this is some really weird shit.  I've never been one to "
"do the smart thing though, myself.  Probably gonna have troubles sleeping "
"until I know what that thing is trying to lead us to."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I know what you mean.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I just like, wanna back up a second.  We're trying to score drugs for a "
"cyborg so it can do surgery on you?  That's really where life's taking us, "
"now?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "…Yes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*grins.  \"Okay, just wanted to clear that up.  I thought maybe I was having "
"some kind of psychotic break, glad it's at least mutual.  Anyway, first place "
"that comes to mind for that kinda stuff would be a hospital, but that's "
"suicide.  Maybe a pharmacy?  Would they have the right stuff?  Seems like a "
"stretch.  Maybe like, a vet clinic or a private surgery clinic might be "
"safer?  I'll level with you, I never got into anything harder than Mary Jane, "
"this is past my pay grade.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Something about this kinda rubs me the wrong way, my friend.  I don't know "
"what it is.  That Rubik guy seems nice enough but I feel like we're not "
"getting the whole story.  Just tread carefully, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Seems to me we could be wandering the area forever just looking for this "
"thing, to be honest.  I guess we could go up somewhere high like a radio "
"tower, maybe with some binoculars, and see if we can spot it?  Our best bet "
"might be to ask a few folks that have been around though, pool our resources."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*leans in close, speaking softly, clearly trying to avoid notice from the "
"pizzaiolo.  \"Are you sure we should be hanging with this guy?  He's not "
"exactly all there, is he?  He reminds me a bit of Chris before things went "
"all chompy-chompy.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Chill, man.  It's just a little light arson, it'll be fine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"I hear you, but he's following us now and I don't know how else to get rid of "
"him."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I guess everything else is wrecked already anyway, what's one more burning "
"building?  And like, it *does* sound fun.  Let's just keep an eye on this "
"guy, he's a slice short of a full pie, if you catch my drift."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I knew you'd come around.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"True enough, and I don't wanna like, just *kill* him.  Well, I don't have "
"anything against a bonfire this season I suppose.  Let's just make sure "
"neither of us ends up lying face-down in a wood-fired oven, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "We're on the same page.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"No.\"  He stares at you, his eyes wild.  For a moment, you barely know the "
"man in front of you.  \"The things I've seen when I wore that mask… it "
"changes you.  It's a burden you can't truly understand unless you've borne "
"it.\"  He shudders, and becomes again the Liam you know.  \"Anyone who "
"chooses to keep wearing it after the end of the world… putting them down "
"would be a kindness, believe me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Uh… okay.  I'd like your opinion on something else, anyway."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*shrugs.  \"My thoughts on Murder Mario haven't changed much, but he hasn't "
"killed us yet.  I don't love the idea of just killing some other survivors "
"for him.  Foodperson doesn't count.\"  He shudders and takes a quick breath.  "
"\"I have a funny feeling they won't let us talk them out of there, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"What if the cake is a lie?  Also do you really want to follow this guy back "
"to his house?  We both know that's not tomato sauce on his apron.  Don't eat "
"anything he cooks.\"  He shrugs, giving a nonplussed look.  \"Still, we've "
"committed actual murder for him multiple times now, so I guess I'm being a "
"bit of a hypocrite.  Let's party."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You didn't have fun?  I think this whole adventure has been a…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"I think it's worth it all, for the cake.  I'd like your opinion on something "
"else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"…SLICE!\"  Liam shouts along with you, then gives you a leaping high five "
"before dissolving into belly laughter.  \"OK fine, that makes all the murder "
"and arson worth it, you mad bastard."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That, and the cake.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I feel like at some point we must have switched to playing Stardew Valley, "
"and I'm not quite sure when that happened.\"  He scratches his head.  \"Oh "
"well, let's just be sure to wear gumboots."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "And aprons.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"BUGHUNT!\"  Liam raises his arms over his head and grins.  \"BUUUG HUUUNT!\"  "
"He mimes stomping on ants.  \"I'm doing my part!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I did actually want your opinion on something though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It's all good, I never minded doing deliveries, especially with a friend for "
"company.  I guess we could try to find lumber in a lumberyard, right?  "
"Probably not a lot of zombies hanging out in lumber yards.  Or maybe we could "
"find an old barn and knock it down and take all the pieces.\"  He laughs.  "
"\"Or saw it ourselves from scratch, if you're feeling like a mad lad.  Make "
"sure we've got a vehicle that can fit it though, that much lumber ain't gonna "
"fit in a hatchback."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Something, something, wood pun, something something.  This is starting to "
"feel like Settlers of Catan, think they'll give us some sheep in return?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Six ropes?  I find it hard to believe these guys can't just get 'em "
"themselves, but, uh, OK I guess.  Maybe we could take some old seatbelts and "
"tie them together, or something.  It shouldn't be hard to find a few ropes "
"laying around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Okay, wait, what?  One wood saw?  Why are you agreeing to this?  I like "
"deliveries as much as the next guy, but it's a *single wood saw*.  It's "
"starting to feel like you'll just agree to do anything anyone asks.\"  He "
"sighs.  \"No worries though I guess.  One time I delivered a single cold soda "
"to a guy living way out in the back woods.  Cost him seventy bucks.  People "
"are weird."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "A shovel?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yeah, a shovel."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "A shovel."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/generic_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "You're not joking."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "*stares at you for a few seconds.  \"At the shovel store, I guess.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"What now, a vegetable peele… oh, a smoker?  That's actually kinda legit I "
"guess.  Maybe we should hunt through peoples' backyards.  We could jump over "
"fences like in Shaun of the Dead!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm not a great expert on guns, to be honest.  I know how to shoot a bit, but "
"my focus was always on archery when I was a kid.  That sounds like a pretty "
"rare gun though, I think maybe we should see if we can find some old "
"collector rather than trying to raid a gun store?  Just a guess."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Nah, you got it.  This is the sort of job that never, ever went wrong, "
"certainly not in any one of a thousand TV tropes.  Let's go find an unknown "
"old man in a secluded cabin."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Glad we're on the same page.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Hell yeah I am.  This guy seems nice.  Bunnies are cute.  This is the sort of "
"job I like, let's find him some logs.  We should be able to just hunt around "
"the woods for 'em, right?  Might need a hatchet or a saw."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It sure does!  Is it blackberry season though?  I guess if they're not ripe, "
"we could check around abandoned kitchens and fridges, see if we can find some "
"that are still intact."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Nah.  Lapin's sweet.  I wanna smoke a joint with the bunny man.  If you ever "
"turn into a zombie I'm gonna come back here and settle down as an assistant "
"bunny tamer.  Hope you don't mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "No hard feelings.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"An anvil?  Where do you come up with this stuff?  Yeah, I met this guy, "
"Wile-E Coyote, he had a bunch of 'em."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll track him down.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm worried for these guys.  My gut tells me they're dealing with something "
"really dangerous.  Let's make sure we're packing heat, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Roger that.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You can say that again.  This is some serious shit, my friend.  I know we've "
"been through a lot, but this might be the big one.  We need to make sure "
"we're ready for anything before we even consider going in there."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Roger that.  I'd like your opinion on something else, first."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"After the shit these poor bastards have gone through, picking some dandelions "
"for them seems kind of anticlimactic.  Still, I am a big fan of dandelion "
"wine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Picking flowers in a field seems okay to me.  I don't mind helping Claire "
"out, she's a nice enough person.  Gotta say though, I get a bit of a weird "
"vibe off these guys.  They're so… I don't know.  It's like we walked into a "
"Norman Rockwell painting in the middle of the end of the world."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Bee bombs!  Kaboom!\"  He mimes an explosion with his hands.  \"Seriously "
"though it's a very versatile plant, we should get some seeds for ourselves."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll see what I can do.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"I was going to make a joke about herding cats, but yours is "
"better.  I was always more of a dog man myself, I don't know anything about "
"catching a feral cat.  Maybe we open a can of tuna?  Or is that a cliché?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"I'm still… 'feline' it out myself.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Even if we work together it's gonna take a while to just find enough good "
"rocks lying around.  We'll probably want to get a shovel and dig around a bit "
"maybe?  Or break up bigger ones with a sledge.  I'm impressed at these guys, "
"keeping going after everything that's happened."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Even if we work together it's gonna take a while to just find enough good "
"rocks lying around.  We'll probably want to get a shovel and dig around a bit "
"maybe?  Or break up bigger ones with a sledge.  Something about this stuff "
"feels weird to me though.  Too pastoral for the apocalypse."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Yeah, I hear you.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Gathering sand sounds, honestly, sort of pleasant.  Like, meditative, you "
"know?  Maybe we find some batteries and get a bit of music going, smoke a "
"joint if you're so inclined, then fill some buckets of sand for Eddie to do "
"whatever the hell he's doing with it.  No zombies, no gunfire, just sand."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"I believe he's making bricks.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I like a good, well defined physical job.  Let's go to the riverside!  I feel "
"like the odds of getting badly injured while gathering clay are sort of low.  "
"Make sure to get some music going though, right?  Maybe bring some "
"refreshments?  And shovels."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You do make it sound good.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Big jars aren't really that uncommon.  Lots of people got super into canning "
"in the last few months before shit really hit the fan, like they did with "
"toilet paper a few years back.  Maybe a bit more reasonable, I guess, though "
"learning how to pickle meat probably didn't save anyone from zombies.  I bet "
"we can track down a few just by raiding houses, and if they're not empty "
"we'll just have to eat what's inside or something."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Do you need a snack, man?  Never mind.  I'd like your opinion on something "
"else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'm sort of surprised they don't have plenty of wheat seeds of their own,\" "
"Liam shrugs.  \"What the hell do I know about farming though?  Nothing, "
"that's what.  Including having no idea about where to find wheat seeds, sorry "
"man.  I would have said 'on a farm' but we're on one and they're asking us, "
"so I just don't know what to think anymore.  My life is a shambles."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Fair enough.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You know, it's a harmful stereotype that wolves are dangerous to humans.  Of "
"course I'm not afraid.\"  He smirks at you, then grins.  \"Except let's be "
"honest, this is probably going to be a giant monster zombie wolf or "
"something, right?  Let's go take the bastard down."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "That's the spirit.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Fast, unidentified monsters are killing the local wildlife, and we're going "
"to get 'em.\"  He looks thoughtful.  \"I'm pretty sure this was an episode of "
"the X-Files.  Or like, several episodes?  As long as we're Scully and Mulder "
"we'll be fine, but if we're the local cops coming in to investigate, we're "
"*toast*.  Just in case, let's make sure we've got our good gear."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Will do, Scully.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Funny you should ask, yeah I have.  My dad borrowed it from the library once "
"and I leafed through it.  So I guess we could try looking at a library?  I "
"got no better ideas, I was like thirteen, I don't remember what was in the "
"thing, and he got all pissy at me for checking it out anyway."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well, yeah he does, because he's a man of discerning tastes.\"  Liam nods "
"approvingly.  \"Or because he wants something to prop his car up while he "
"changes the tire.  It's a big book, is what I'm saying.  We should make sure "
"we've got a copy for ourselves though, it's one of the prepper bibles."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Great info, thanks.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*leans in close, speaking softly.  \"I do not say this lightly: this "
"motherfucker has *seen some shit*.  Look at that thousand-yard-stare.  We did "
"a good thing getting him out, but I don't know if he's ever really gonna be "
"*out*, you know?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you think we can do anything for him?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "He'll suck it up.  We've all been through shit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Scary stuff.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We can get him home in one piece.  Get him back to his people.  I'd offer him "
"a drink or a toke, but I think they're like, Amish or something.  After that, "
"our best bet is to make ourselves scarce, to him we're always gonna be the "
"people he met in the tower.  He won't wanna be reminded of that."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How do you know so much about this?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*looks abruptly uncomfortable.  \"You know a bit about me and my dad, right?  "
"I went to counseling for a few years after I got out.  Since what went down "
"with Chris, I've been thinking about it more too.\"  He shakes his head.  "
"\"We could all use a decent counsellor, honestly.  Even before the world "
"ended.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks, man.  You have layers.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Yeah, I guess we have.\"  Liam looks off into the distance for a moment.  "
"\"We sure fuckin' have."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Damn straight.  I'd like your opinion on something else."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*rubs his chin.  \"Mmmaaaybe?  What kind of chef?  I worked as a dishwasher "
"in a fancy place for a couple months.  If they're a line chef, then yes.  "
"Sous-chef or above?  Leave 'em for the zombies.  I hated that job.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Duly noted.  I'd like your opinion on something else, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Seems like a good idea to me.  If they're alive, then we meet some new "
"people, that's always fun.\"  He hesitates.  \"Well, it used to always be "
"fun.  New people are a bit scarier these days.  But still, as a general rule, "
"I'm a fan.  Anyway, if they're not alive, then we clear 'em out and we have a "
"farm of our very own.  It's win-win, as long as none of us gets devoured by "
"an undead menace."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Well summarized.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"We could if you want.  I got complex feelings about prepper cabins in the "
"woods, obviously.  As far as loot goes though, they're pretty top tier, and "
"low-risk.  Maybe we'll find a nice bow.  Or like, guns or whatever.  Or a bow!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"You and your death springs.  I'd like your opinion on something else, "
"actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Fuck yeah we should.  Usually I'd be all, 'be careful my friend, preppers "
"leave traps 'n shit', but in this case we have said prepper's word on the "
"matter.  We could be running our operation from a cozy, well protected "
"bunker!  What are we waiting for?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks for the enthusiasm.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Normally I'd say something about needing to be careful, blah blah, and that's "
"all true, but we're doing this for a friend, so I'm way more keen.  Let's "
"help out our new pal.  The three of us can handle this, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Right on.  I'd like your opinion on something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I want to talk about something a bit more fundamental now."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can we chat about something else?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid " *pshhhttt* This is big turtle, I read you loud and clear, red burrito."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "So, here we are.  What's up?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Big turtle?  Red burrito?  Seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "*shrugs.  \"Not my favorite job, but sure.  I'll keep an eye out.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"As you know, I am experienced in practically every low-wage job on the "
"Eastern seaboard, and I'm probably a regional leading expert on video games.  "
"My dad made me learn archery and I kinda kept it up.  What else is there?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Sounds weird calling it \"orders\", I'm your friend, not your minion.  No "
"worries though, what up?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Sure, what do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I mean, I'm not sure what I can teach you about, but okay."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Don't sell yourself short, Liam.  I just wanted to know about…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "A… seminar?  About what, how not to burn yourself on the frier at Foodplace?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Y'know, you have more useful skills than you think."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Roger that red burrito, that's a ten-forward on the callsigns.  Glad you like "
"'em."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_main_dialogue.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You're weird, my friend.  Red burrito, out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Years ago, you and your old group of friends made a pact.  It seemed like a "
"joke at the time: if the world ended, you'd all meet up at Liam's cabin, if "
"you could, and work together to help each other out.  Now, the unthinkable "
"has happened, and somehow you've made it out in one piece.  It's been years "
"since you saw those friends, though you've kept a little bit in touch on "
"social media, and you can only hope that the others perhaps took the idea "
"seriously.  Even if they did, it would be a hard trip.  The roads were "
"blocked off by military forces trying to prevent the riots from spreading, "
"and you had to make the last part of the journey on foot.\n"
"\n"
"As the morning light breaks into day, you've reached Liam's cabin, a "
"ramshackle building in the woods outside <city>.  You can see Liam's car in "
"front, looking a bit more run down since you last saw him a few years ago.  "
"You feel a swell of relief: at least Liam seems to have made it!  As you "
"approach the door, you hear a shout of terror from inside, and then the "
"unmistakable sound of a gunshot.  Were you a moment too late?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'd better get in there and check it out."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#. ~ Special NPC you can only meet through the 'start with a friend' scenario.
#. Will need his own class and items before completing this.
msgid "Liam"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "expert in entry level jobs"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ Job description of "expert in entry level jobs" NPC class
msgid "It's you and me in this together, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*, your old friend, stares at you with blank, confused eyes.  He is standing "
"over a freshly mangled corpse, a smoking shotgun at his feet.  \"Holy shit "
"dude.\"  He blinks.  \"Is this about Chris?  If you're here to kill me, just "
"get it over with man.  I don't know what the fuck is happening but I can't "
"take you out too.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Get ahold of yourself, man.  What's happening?  Chris?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"*gestures at the body.  \"Chris.  You know Chris, you've known Chris for "
"years.  We all agreed to meet up here if shit got bad, remember?  We got here "
"around the same time, set up a little camp.  Something seemed really off "
"since we arrived though, Chris kept going on and on about how the food wasn't "
"good enough.\"  He shifts his gaze back to you, eyes red.  \"We got plenty of "
"food!  I tried to calm him down but just now the fucker came running in with "
"an axe, tried to take my head off!  I… I…\" Liam gestures again to the "
"corpse.  \"Then you came in.  Do you got anything to do with this?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"I heard gunshots, so I came in to see what's up.  I was just on my way here "
"to see if you'd made it."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well, shit.  I'm guessing my story sounds like a lot of bullshit then.\"  "
"Liam sags into the sofa behind him, wiping his eyes with his sleeve.  \"What "
"the hell are we gonna do?  Holy shit."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"I believe you.  People have been acting crazy for weeks, it must have got "
"Chris too.  Come on.  We're in this together."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Pull yourself together.  You did what you had to.  The shit has hit the fan, "
"no time for moping around."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Thanks.  It's good to hear that.  Look, I'm sure I should be questioning you "
"and making sure you're not gonna attack me with an axe or something, but I "
"just can't anymore.  Come on, let's get Chris out of here and then figure out "
"what to do next."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sure thing.  <lets_go>"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"All right, yeah.  Fair call.  I'm just a bit shell shocked, but it's good to "
"see you.  Let's get Chris out of here and figure out what to do next"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_starting_follower.json
#. ~ Mission name
msgid "Check to see if Liam is OK"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid " *pshhhttt* Hey stinkyface.  It's your favorite mushroom girl.  Over."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I love just standing around, it's what I was made for."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My 'abilities'?  I can shapeshift, and teleport, but I can't do it on "
"command.  Also, I have unique powers of thyroid failure."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Sure.  Here we are, talking."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What's your story, anyway?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Seriously?  You figure you're the boss of me now?  Fine, whatever, what do "
"you want me to do."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Yeah, sure, why not.  I love hearing myself talk.  What did you want to know "
"about?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You mean you'll talk about more than just mushrooms?  What've you got?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"What?  You're not content with me being a personal tutor, now you want to "
"start a post-apocalyptic university?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Come on, you love hearing yourself talk."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"You kind of already know, don't you?  I used to be a post-doc researcher in "
"mycology, then I wound up stuck in the lobby at that stupid refugee center, "
"then you came and yeeted us all out of there.  What more is there?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I don't remember, did you tell me how you wound up in that place?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Pretty sure I did, but I do love hearing the sound of my own voice.  I got "
"evacuated on to the local concentration center, then picked up on a "
"repurposed school bus and dragged out to that shithole.  We heard the place "
"was getting more people than they could fit, and the few who'd got there "
"first had set up some sort of self-appointed processing lineup.  The chick "
"processing me to get in saw my Chinese name and conveniently 'lost' my "
"paperwork.  I was sent out to the lobby to wait for 'further processing', "
"while I watched busloads of people get processed and taken in.  By the time "
"they 'found' my paperwork, wouldn't you know it, the place was too full for "
"me.  They oh-so-kindly let me camp out in the front since I'd been on one of "
"the first buses."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I can read the newspapers as well as anyone, I know how people who look like "
"me get smeared.  My grandparents were from China.  That means I'm obviously "
"personally responsible for all this.  I don't know any other reason they let "
"hundreds of other educated people in and left me sitting out there to rot."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well, before <the_cataclysm> I was working at a university bookstore, "
"remember?  But that was just an in-between after finishing my PhD, while I "
"looked for a post-doc placement I was interested in.  Which, I suppose, I've "
"got now?  You didn't recruit my for my fragile body, intractable obesity, or "
"sunny disposition."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
