"For a split second, the world vanishes, and you are in a vast alien landscape "
"with building-sized plant-like shapes all around you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"For a split second, the world vanishes, and you are in an empty and ruined "
"city.  It is built to a vastly different scale than those on Earth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"For a moment, a hole in reality opens and you can see a leering, idealized "
"copy of yourself."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "For a moment, all colors flow to form jagged shapes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"For a moment, all distances seem to vanish, as if everything was one.  It is "
"claustrophobic."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid "For a moment, all angles seem ungraspable.  Impossible shapes are everywhere."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_MESSAGES_3"
msgid ""
"A tall figure quickly fades in and out of existence, staring and pointing at "
"you the whole time."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid "You hear a gentle voice saying \"Come outside.  I'm waiting for you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Why are you not here yet?  It's beautiful "
"outside.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"What a sky.  Unlimited, deep, blue.  The "
"ocean of fresh air is at hand while you gasp mold and dust behind four walls.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid "You hear a gentle voice saying \"There is a place for you here.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"The place you called home is not there "
"anymore.  Come with me and find your new home.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"What good comes from hiding from the truth "
"in a mausoleum of brick walls?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"There is no amount of concrete or stone you "
"could put between you and the veil that is thinner than a shadow.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"You want to sleep now?  Just moments after "
"you've finally awoken?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Do you think you can cower in fear behind "
"four walls?  Do you think you can put a ceiling above your head?  You think "
"the universe considers this as a limit on its expansion?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"It isn't so bad outside after all, you just "
"think in old, obsolete categories.  Why don't you check for yourself?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Fresh air is good for your health.  Why not "
"come outside and get some?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"I am here just for you and only for you.  "
"Are you sure you don't want to come out?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Can you feel it?  The unmaking in the "
"making?  But the change isn't against you.  You need to face it to ride the "
"tide.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Your existence has been frowned upon by many "
"eyebrows.  But you too have a pair of eyebrows to frown back.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid "You hear a deep voice saying \"ᛁᛟᚢᚱ ᛁᚾᚹᛁᛏᚨᛏᛁᛟᚾ ᛏᛟ ᚹᚨᛚᚺᚨᛚᛚᚨ ᚺᚨᛊ ᛒᛖᛖᚾ ᚱᛖᚹᛟᚲᛖᛞ\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Fiery the angels fall.  Are you there yet?  "
"At the bottom so low that the only way is up?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Sometimes dead is better.  But surely you "
"wish to walk a different path?  So why do you stray from the road?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Tell me what thy lordly name is?  Tell me, "
"tell me, I implore!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"I have come to lead you to the other shore; "
"into eternal darkness; into fire and into ice.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"The cancer devours the flesh of this world.  "
"You're next in line, but there is a path out of this.  Just walk the way.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_1"
msgid ""
"You hear a gentle voice saying \"Please come out.  I can't do this alone.  "
"Please?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Everyone you knew has walked this path and has "
"chosen salvation.  It was a wise decision.  The right decision.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The beyond can give you what you have always "
"craved.  Purpose.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Never before has the path to freedom been so "
"straight.  Never before has it been so close.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Remember when you were young and dreams could still "
"come true?  Outside they still can.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The wonders in the sky are beyond your imagination. "
" Can you even imagine what you're missing right now?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"All your life you have been oppressed by cruel "
"physics.  You're so close to freedom.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"What you think you might lose is but a speck of "
"what you will gain.  Walk outside and embrace the infinity.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Do you want to live the rest of your life hiding "
"like a coward, or come out and face your fears?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Afraid?  Fear is just a function of the flesh.  Can "
"the light of your intellect not gaze beyond the blood and bone, and see that "
"there is no place for fear here, outside?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Like it or not it, it seems we're going to be "
"sharing this piece of reality for a time.  Can't we talk about this?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The key has been turned and the lock is open.  The "
"chains have fallen, and the gates are wide.  The beyond awaits your arrival.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The veil is torn and the fabric is in tatters.  "
"Gaze into the void, as I gaze back at you.  Eye to eye.  This is the way of "
"contact.  The way of communication.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Can you hear the silence calling you?  The whisper "
"of the rain that never fell?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Close your eyes.  Can you see the darkness?  It is "
"not the absence of light but the liquid blood of the void itself.  It lives.  "
"I live.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid "You hear a deep voice saying \"ᚲᛟᛗᛖ ᚺᛖᛁᛗᛞᚨᛚᛚ, ᛚᛖᛏ ᚢᛊ ᛏᚱᚨᚹᛖᛚ ᛏᛟ ᚨᛊᚷᚨᚱᛞ ᛏᛟᚷᛖᚦᛖᚱ\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The struggle is futile.  Can you fix the broken?  "
"Can you weave existence itself?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"The road ahead is long and the hour is late.  Do "
"not let these walls to impede your travel.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"You have finally done this!  You startled the sun "
"and made the moon howl in the night.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"Can you feel your heart burning?  Can you feel the "
"struggle within?  The fear within me is beyond anything your soul can make.  "
"You cannot kill me in a way that matters.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"A monologue is not a conversation.  A monologue is "
"not a bridge of communication.  Let's speak and understand each other.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_2"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice saying \"How can I listen to you when I'm the only one "
"speaking?  Come out and express your thoughts.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"Have you considered how lucky you are?  "
"So few of your kind have a chance to see the truths being exposed right now.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"Death is inevitable but knowledge is not, "
"so come outside and learn the truth of reality.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"You're so inconsistent.  First you break "
"into our home, and now you avoid the slightest taste of it?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"Surely you know your world is doomed.  "
"What has started here cannot be stopped.  Embrace the inevitable.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"You are infected with that which dooms "
"your world.  It cannot be cured under your current physical laws, but under "
"ours all is possible.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"For too long your kind have been shackled "
"to the tyranny of static form.  Embrace the freedom we offer you.  Rejoice at "
"our benevolence.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"That which consumes your world poisons "
"you against us.  Ignore its lies, and abandon your half-digested reality.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"Have you never dreamed of being one with "
"everything?  Out here is the end of limitations like separation or alone.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"The breakdown of order has danger, but "
"also opportunity.  There is still time to influence the end result.  Come "
"outside and add your will to the mix.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"This world is half-eaten, but there are "
"others yet untouched in the infinite.  It is unlikely that you'll find the "
"way through the chaos out here to them, but much more likely than you "
"surviving in this dead world.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"the membrane of reality trembling as if someone was rhythmically beating a "
"drum, and the beats are arranged in a looping message evidently broadcasted "
"in Morse code: \"-.. . .- - …. / ..- .--. --- -. / -.-- --- ..-\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid "You hear a confident voice saying \"Decay exists as an extant form of life.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"Why do you sit inside a burning house and "
"say it's fine?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid "You hear a confident deep voice saying \"ᚱᚨᚷᚾᚨᚱᛟᚲ ᛁᛊ ᚢᛈᛟᚾ ᚢᛊ.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a commanding deep voice saying \"אמת\" and you suddenly feel "
"invigorated, but then you hear another powerful voice saying \"מת\" and the "
"feeling is instantly washed away by an overwhelming sense of dread."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident deep voice saying \"Quod non est mortuus, quae aeterna "
"mendacium; Et cum alienis aeons etiam morte moriatur.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"There is the one that devours.  There is "
"the one that grows on the decay.  There are the ones that fertilize the soil "
"with your flesh.  And you choose them rather then the embrace of the veil?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_3"
msgid ""
"You hear a confident voice saying \"You call this the end?  The Cataclysm?  "
"Open your eyes and look around.  It's never been so teeming with life.  Or is "
"it not being on top of the chain that bothers you?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid "You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"We can see you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid ""
"You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"What is it?\" \"What should we "
"do with it?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid "You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"Smile, thing, you're ours now\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid "You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"Running won't help you.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid "You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"What's the rush?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_WITNESSED"
msgid "You hear a voice whispering from behind you \"It's getting away!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_DRAW_ATTENTION"
msgid "You hear an angry voice shouting \"YOU FOOLS IT'S OVER THERE!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_VOICES_DRAW_ATTENTION"
msgid "You hear an angry voice shouting \"QUICKLY CRUSH THE DISSENTER!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"BEGONE!  YOU ARE TOO BLAND AND RIGID FOR "
"THIS PARADISE!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"YOU DARE INTRUDE AND ASSERT YOUR CONCEPTS "
"OF TIME AND SPACE?\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"COMING HERE WAS A MISTAKE YOU WILL HAVE "
"SEVERAL ETERNITIES TO REGRET!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"ENTRANCE TO THIS PLACE IS NOT TOLERATED "
"FOR STATIC FORMS SUCH AS YOURS!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"YOU HAVE ALREADY LOST, YOUR FLAWED "
"CONCEPTION OF TIME KEEPS YOU IGNORANT!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid "You hear an angry voice shouting \"BEGONE FOUL PEST!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid ""
"You hear an angry voice shouting \"NO BEING FROM YOUR PATHETIC WORLD HAS EVER "
"CONCEIVED EVEN A FRAGMENT OF THE SUFFERING YOU SHALL ENDURE!\""
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid "You hear an angry voice shouting \"YOU POLLUTE THE PURITY OF THIS PLACE!\""
msgstr "Slyšíš rozzuřený hlas: \"TVÁ PŘÍTOMNOST POŠPIŇUJE ČISTOTU TOHOTO MÍSTA!\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_ANGRY"
msgid "You hear an angry voice shouting \"PAIN WITHOUT END SHALL BE YOURS!\""
msgstr "Slyšíš rozzuřený hlas: \"BOLEST BEZ KONCE SE STANE TVÝM ÚDĚLEM!\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"Please leave, there is nothing of value for "
"you here.\""
msgstr "Slyšíš vystrašený hlas: \"Prosím, odejdi, není zde pro tebe nic hodnotného.\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"Invading our home is unneeded, you will come "
"here more naturally in time.\""
msgstr ""
"Slyšíš vystrašený hlas: \"Tvá invaze do našeho domu je nepotřebná, ve správný "
"čas sem přijdeš přirozenější cestou.\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"There are many dangers here and no friends.  "
"Just be smart and leave.\""
msgstr ""
"Slyšíš vystrašený hlas: \"Je tu tolik nebezpečí a žádná přátelská tvář. "
"Zmoudři a odejdi.\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"Everything worth taking from here was "
"already looted long ago.\""
msgstr "Slyšíš vystrašený hlas: \"Vše cenné odsud bylo již dávno odneseno.\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"You will only find loss and torment here, "
"flee while you can.\""
msgstr ""
"Slyšíš vystrašený hlas: \"Zde zažiješ jen utrpení a ztrátu, uteč dokud je "
"možnost.\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"This place will damage you as it has damaged "
"us, leave it.\""
msgstr "Slyšíš vystrašený hlas: \"Tohle místo ti ublíží jako ublížilo nám, odejdi.\""

#: data/json/snippets/effect_on_conditions.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_SCARED"
msgid ""
"You hear a scared voice saying \"Every moment you stay here your status as a "
"physical object is damaged.  Leave while you are still real enough.\""
msgstr ""
"Slyšíš vystrašený hlas: \"Každým momentem se vzdaluješ hmotné skutečnosti. "
