#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid "I am SO glad I don't need to deal with taxes or debt anymore."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid "Geez, this is nothing like those Hollywood zombie films!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid "Do you ever think about the ethics of killing <zombies>?"
msgstr "Napadlo tě někdy jestli je etické zabít <zombies>?"

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid ""
"Do you think living on a farm is dangerous because the roosters might attract "
"<zombies>?"
msgstr ""
"Myslíš, že je je bezpečné bydlet na farmě? Kohouti by mohli přilákat "
"pozornost <zombies>."

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid ""
"I have dreamed of owning a house by the sea, but now I have nightmares of "
"what lurks beneath the waves."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid ""
"I liked walking through the forest, listening to the chirping of the birds "
"but now I am afraid that the birds might devour me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid "So you wet your toothbrush AFTER you apply toothpaste?  That's so weird."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid "So is it pronounced gif or gif?"
msgstr "Vyslovuje se to gif nebo giv?"

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid "What do you think the president is doing right now?"
msgstr "Co asi teď dělá prezident?"

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid ""
"What do you like to listen to?  Personally I'm into bass-heavy post-glam "
"speed polka."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid "Don't tell anyone else, but sometimes I like to sleep holding my teddy bear."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid "Sometimes I see weird shit in the sky at night."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid "Did you see the <weird_sky_thing> in the sky last night, too?"
msgstr "Vyděl jsi také minulou noc na obloze <weird_sky_thing>?"

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid "I used to have a cat.  I really miss Mr. Cuddles…"
msgstr "Měl jsem kočku. Stýská se mi Ťunťo."

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid ""
"My friends and I used to play cops-and-robbers, except with zombies.  Never "
"thought I'd be in it for real…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid ""
"We both need to cheer up, so here is a joke: What do you call a sleepy car?  "
"Tired!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid ""
"I still think about when the rioters and my neighbors tore each other to "
"shreds…"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid ""
"One day I greeted the mailman but his eyes were bloodshot and he aggressively "
"threw letters at me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid ""
"This is nothing compared to just two months ago.  Everything is getting "
"bigger and more dangerous with each day that passes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
msgid "Do you ever think that we're in some kind of simulation?"
msgstr "Myslíš, že bychom mohli být uvnitř simulace?"

