#. ~ Description of furniture "chirurgic suite"
msgid ""
"A multitude of surgical arms seamlessly meld with the chromed ceiling.  They "
"expectantly unravel with your approach, animated by an AI whose performances "
"blur the lines between medicine and art."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/maps/furniture.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture.json
#. ~ Furniture name
