#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
#. ~ Description of monster "bloodhound drone"
msgid ""
"A small, spiked quadcopter robot equipped with a high-power spotlight.  This "
"automated seeker drone was originally designed to harry and harass fugitives "
"while maintaining visual contact for other pursuers."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/robots.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/monsters/robots.json
