#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
msgid "Mercurial augmentation tech."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&The Mercurial store is attended by a massive clerk, sleek scales adorn their "
"massive forearms and slightly pointed ears.  They greet you with a voice that "
"is both deep and melodious, \"Welcome to Mercurial Genetech, where we can "
"help you unlock your potential.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm looking into augments"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How does this Genetech stuff works?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Mercurial/clerk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&The clerk smiles, \"Our Genetech is a marvel of modern science, capable of "
"rewriting your very DNA.  We offer a wide range of treatments, from the "
"mundanely medical to the exotic.  You need only select one of our templates "
"and visit one of our editing machines in both ends of this store.  If you "
"ever have doubts, remember that all our treatments are reversible.\""
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
msgid "salvage merchant"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#. ~ Job description of "salvage merchant" NPC class
msgid "Salvor Fabricator"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
msgid "Veronica Donaldson"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator.json
#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
msgid "salvor fabricator"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&As you approach the counter, you can't help but notice the chaotic scene "
"before you: Juxtaposed to the makeshift structure, an awkward marriage of "
"ship hulls and foamcrete walls, stands neatly arranged shelving, and "
"near-pristine furniture.  The tools and parts lining the shelves have each "
"been meticulously arranged.  A Salvor sits behind the counter with her arm "
"perched on the surface, supporting her head in her hand.  In her other hand, "
"she idly waves a cigarette, making small circles in the air.  Gray hairs peek "
"out from the edges of her Cryo suit, and her wrinkle-creased face wears a "
"permanent scowl."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "[Approach the counter]"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Great, another Earther descends from the heavens.  Did you come all the way "
"here to grace us with your presence?  If you've any brains in that thick "
"skull: you take whatever money you have left and get your sorry ass off this "
"rock.  Salus ain't for you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I can't do that."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You got some kind of problem with Earthers?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Your kind are all the same.  Born on the ol' celestial throne Sol, silver "
"spoon in your mouth.  Everywhere you go, you're walk'n and talk'n like you "
"own the place.  Bumbling through the stars without a clue.  Spit'n out the "
"Corpo bullshit they been feeding you till you die for the glory of ol' Earth. "
" I've seen enough Earth kids come through here to know you type.  Here to "
"bite it just like they did?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I didn't come here to die."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Course you didn't.  But death's all you'll find here.  You step into those "
"icy wastes and you ain't wandering back.  A bot'll blow your brains out or a "
"Wraith splatter you into some many pieces that even the med bots can't put "
"your carcass back together.  And if you ain't lucky the moxies'll mob you.  "
"Now the way they tear a person apart, it ain't a sight that ever leaves you."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Leaving isn't an option for me."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Another new face.  So what'll it be this time?  Corpo Business?  Treasure "
"Hunting?  Bounty Hunt?  Or maybe you heard about the lovely weather here and "
"just had to experience it yourself?  Save yourself the trouble, there ain't "
"nothing for you on Salus.  Want my advice?  Get off world 'fore some bot "
"plasters your brains all over the snow."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Whatever you think your reasons are they ain't worth it.  Salus'll chew you "
"up and spit you back out.  A quick death here is a mercy.  Get off world no "
"matter what it costs you: That's how you survive."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm not backing down."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you talk to all your customers like this?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Veronica looks you up and down discerningly and a small smile creases her "
"lips.\n"
"So you got some spine, good.  Some of the kids that come through here fold "
"the minute the pressure's on.  They don't have a damn clue what's waiting for "
"them out there.  You, well come back alive and you can call me impressed."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So, what do you actually do here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Veronica looks you up and down discerningly and scoffs.\n"
"You don't have what it takes kid.  But I won't beat a dead horse.  If you're "
"set on this: best you get geared up before you head out there.  Got some good "
"stuff here that might save your life."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"A small smile tugs at the edge of Veronica's lips.\n"
"Tch.  No, just the ones I like.  If you ain't changing your mind then at "
"least take a look around.  Best not to go into those frigid wastes unprepared."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Right then, this here's my shop, and round the back there's my workroom.  "
"I've enough tech here to whip up whatever you need, 'cept for that real fancy "
"glittertech shit.  I sell the sorts of tools folk like you need to do your "
"work.  Stuff that'll get you into places you ain't supposed to be and break "
"apart anything interesting you find.  I'll buy any scraps you get out there "
"and I'll shoot you straight on the prices.  So if you find anything "
"interesting you bring it here first ya hear?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Good to know.  Can I take a look at your stock?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Good to know.  I don't need anything right now though."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "Welcome back.  Planning on buying something or did you just come here to gawk?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Show me what you have in stock."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What brought you to Salus?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/dialog_statue.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
msgid "Nevermind."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Came in with a crew trying to cozy up 'ere on the DL.  It was a shit plan "
"from the start, told 'em as much.  But those scrap-for brains couldn't see "
"the forest for the trees.  Figured they pull a fortune of ship parts from the "
"graveyards and skip planet fat and happy."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What happened to your crew?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Did you ever find anything interesting?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"They're pushing daisies in the great beyond.  Not a single one of them made "
"it off this hell.  Not like I didn't warn them.  They just kept fooling "
"around in places one of us had any business being."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Tch, sure.  Plenty.  But we never got our hands on any of it.  Not a single "
"thing worth taking comes as easily as you like, and you'd do well to remember "
"that."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What was the coolest thing you ever found?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Noted."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Drive Core, Cruiser class, mostly intact.  We picked it up on scanners in the "
"stern section of a Titan II class.  It was partially buried at the bottom of "
"a ravine, old gal must a split in the atmo.  Only ever managed a glimpse of "
"the damn thing though."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Net Breacher woke up the Ship's AI.  The bastard fried her brain from the "
"inside out.  Rail from a Wraith turned another two to paste while everyone "
"was still losing their shit.  Rest is a haze of bloody screams and a hail of "
"bullets and plasma.  Few that got out died later of blood loss or froze from "
"suits full o' holes.\n"
"Veronica removes her glove revealing a metallic hand that glints brightly in "
"the dim light of the structure.\n"
"Woulda been dead myself but the plasma burst that took my arm cauterized the "
"wound.  Patched the suit up with foamcrete on my way out.  The Doc had a lot "
"of fun with that one."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Veronica slowly slides her glove back over her hand and meets your eyes with "
"a scornful gaze.\n"
"Those kids were hopeful idiots but they knew what they were doing.  This "
"place 'ill take everything from you no matter how prepared you think you are. "
" Leave as soon as you can.  And stay the hell away from the graveyards."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What happened afterwards, how did you end up here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I pulled myself together and set up this little abode.  Been selling tools "
"and gear to the folk that come through 'ere for a time now.  Buncha upstarts "
"followed suit and set up their own little places.  And now we got our own "
"neighborhood.  If it weren't for the nosey UICA pricks and especially that "
"little shit Atermis I'd almost call it livable."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Why stay?  You must have enough to leave the planet by now?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Well, it ain't like I got someplace to be.  And, well, I can't rightly "
"explain it, but, I feel like I still got business here.  There's a score that "
"needs to be settled, and it just wouldn't sit right leaving things at that.  "
"Salus ain't through with me yet."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/salvor_fabricator_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I understand"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&The workshop is a chaotic mess of spare parts, tools, and partially "
"assembled components littering every surface.  <npc_name> is muttering to "
"himself under his breath when you approach.\n"
"Oh hello, do you need something?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&The workshop is a chaotic mess of spare parts, tools, and partially "
"assembled components littering every surface.  <npc_name> is muttering to "
"himself under his breath when you approach.\n"
"Do you need something salvor?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What do you have in stock?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "You said something about a special offer?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Do you sell any vehicles here?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Is that Lynx still for sale?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "So, why did you come to Salus IV?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&Wait.  Hold on a second, please don't take this the wrong way, but you "
"wouldn't happen to be from Earth by any chance?."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How can you tell?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sorry, you're mistaken."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&I knew it!  I'm from Earth too so I could just tell.  The way you carry "
"yourself, it's not like the rest of the salvors around here.  But you get it "
"right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&Right?  Right!  Of course you do.  You understand!  This place is about as "
"far a cry from civilization as you can get.  And the people, god, the people! "
" This post sees a never-ending deluge of criminals and brawn for brains.  And "
"it's like none of them have even heard of a shower!  Just the other day, a "
"man emerged from the icy waste covered in blood and viscera.  And everyone "
"just ignored him acting like that was a completely normal thing to do!  I am "
"going to get off this god-forsaken rock if it's the last thing I do, I swear "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&No, don't give me that!  I can tell, just by looking at you, I know.  Don't "
"worry, I'm from Earth too!  I get it: some people around here get all weird "
"when they find out where you're from.  But you won't get that from me. Us "
"Earthers got to stick together, right?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "&Sure, whatever you say, pal."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&Right!  Sorry, this is the vehicle bay, and I run the place.  Mostly I just "
"fix up the patrol vehicles.  But I am also in charge of maintaining our stock "
"of vehicle parts.  As such: I've been authorized to trade with salvors in "
"order to get what we need, and can offer you some of our excess stock or "
"chits in exchange.  I'll give you a nice price, just: Don't tell my boss.  "
"And one more thing, I've got something really special for sale, if you're "
"interested."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Can you show me your stock?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What's this special offer?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Thanks, I don't need anything right now."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"This is the vehicle bay, and I run the place.  Please don't touch anything "
"unless you're buying.  I fix up the patrol vehicles and maintain our stock of "
"spare parts.  As such: I've been authorized to trade with outsiders in order "
"to get what we need, and can offer you some of our excess stock or chits in "
"exchange."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Here's the thing: A while back one of our patrol vehicles got totalled when "
"some junior officers took it for a joy ride.  We are in queue to get a "
"replacement issued to us and High Command just wants the old one broken down "
"for parts.  Well the chief and I agree that's a little wasteful.  So I "
"patched the damn thing back together with the parts we had on hand.  And now "
"we're looking for a way to make it, disappear.  You follow?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How much do want for it?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "I'll cut you a deal.  Let's say 30,000 USD and it's all yours."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'll take it"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"&As I've SAID before: I'm only authorized to trade vehicle parts and scraps.  "
"Our patrol vehicles are not up for auction.  Now if you don't mind, I have "
"work to do."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid ""
"Surely you can arrange for a patrol car to be 'lost'.  I can make it worth "
"your while."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/UICA/ground_quartermaster.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_DIVINER.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/UICA/ground_quartermaster.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Nevermind then."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"I'd report you if this sort of behavior wasn't already so laughably "
"perdictable.  Just go away."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"Alright, alright.  Just not so loud.  Here's the thing: A while back one of "
"our patrol vehicles got totalled when some junior officers took it for a joy "
"ride.  We are in queue to get a replacement issued to us and High Command "
"just wants the old one broken down for parts.  Well the chief and I agree "
"that's a little wasteful.  So I patched the damn thing back together with the "
"parts we had on hand.  And now we're looking for a way to make it, disappear."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"<npc_name> sighs.\n"
"Yes it is, are you interested?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "How much do want for it again?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid "40,000 USD and it's all yours."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"It wasn't my choice, obviously.  That fucking bastard back in Alpha Centauri "
"had me transferred to this frozen hell.  Pulled strings with the staff in "
"command.  I signed on to help put Earth back where it belongs: on top.  Not "
"freeze my arse off fixing barely held-together scrap in the middle of fucking "
"nowhere.  Mercurial doesn't even give a shit about this place.  I don't know "
"why the UICA even bothers to station us here.  If you ask me this planet "
"should have stayed abandoned."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Who's the bastard?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "What makes you think Mercurial doesn't care?"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Sorry I asked."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"My former superior officer, the prick.  Always hovering my shoulder like a "
"damn drone.  I won't miss that uptight control freak.  We fought a lot and "
"didn't see things eye to eye.  But this?  I never imagined the fucker would "
"stoop this low.  Hell of a disciplinary action, I'll tell you that much."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
msgid ""
"The last thing they did was set up their little clinic on the station, and "
"they haven't done jack since.  No communications, no re-colonization efforts, "
"no survey teams.  They hardly even seem to care about going down planetside.  "
"Not like I blame them.  The colony didn't work out before so, why bother?  "
"This place is clearly not worth the effort."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "I guess there are some rocks even Corpos won't touch."
msgstr ""

