#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of bionic "Blood Neurology"
msgid ""
"Your blood is laced with neuron-analogue nanites, allowing your entire "
"circulatory system to function as a secondary brain.  This radical "
"modification increases your intelligence, reflexes and perception by 4, "
"increases your pain tolerance and allows you to survive brain damage that "
"would otherwise prove fatal."
