#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/bionics.json
#. ~ Description of bionic "Pain Suppression Injection System"
msgid ""
"The chemical injection system and microcomputer that when activated gives a "
"burst of chemicals that allows your blood to work a little harder at "
"stabilizing the body and then flushes your system with a powerful anesthetic "
"that allows you to continue operating at high capacity.  Upon deactivation, "
"the user may experience extreme lethargy, sudden loss of consciousness, among "
"other symptoms that may prove potentially fatal if not in a safe location."
msgstr ""

