#. ~ Description of "CROWS II, heavy machinegun"
msgid ""
"This is an inactive turret.  Using this item involves loading the unit with "
"the factory-loaded ball heavy machine gun ammunition rounds in your inventory "
"(if you wish to divide your ammunition, set aside whatever ammunition you do "
"NOT want to give the turret) turning it on, and placing it on the ground, "
"where it will attach itself.  If programmed successfully the turret will then "
"identify you as a friendly, and attack all enemies with its heavy machine gun."
