"large thorns.  It provides excellent protection but slightly slows you and "
"makes you vulnerable to fire."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_renew_forest_spell"
msgid "Renewing the Forest"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_renew_forest_spell ( Renewing the Forest )"
msgid ""
"While outdoors and not underground, the druid can create a profusion of life "
"around themselves, causing grass to grow through pavement, bushes and flowers "
"to sprout, and trees to grow to full height in moments.\n"
"\n"
"In <color_yellow>addition to</color> mana, this spell also requires "
"<color_red>hit points</color> to cast and <color_yellow>will fail</color> if "
"you are too injured."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL"
msgid "You do not have enough life force to donate it to renew the forest!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL_2" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL"
msgid ""
"You must be on the surface and not on a building's upper stories to cast "
"Renewing the Forest!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DRUID_RENEW_FOREST_SPELL"
msgid "You must be outside to cast Renewing the Forest!"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_wood_living_tree_spell"
msgid "Shape Wood"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Description of spell "druid_wood_living_tree_spell ( Shape Wood )"
msgid ""
"Using druidic magic, shape living wood into a log that you can use for other "
"projects without harming the tree.  You must cast this spell on a living tree."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/arvore_eocs.json
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_EOC_DRUID_SHAPE_WOOD"
#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREE_SINGING"
msgid "Select nearby tree"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_EOC_DRUID_SHAPE_WOOD"
msgid ""
"The wood of the tree grows and forms as you cast the spell and when it ends, "
"there is a log lying on the ground, entirely covered in bark but otherwise "
"straight and ready to be used in other projects."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/druid.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#. ~ Name of spell "druid_anti_heat"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_druid_anti_heat"
