msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Magiclysm/Spells/earthshaper.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spell_scrolls.json
#. ~ Description of spell "recover_stamina ( Stone's Endurance )"
#. ~ Description of "Scroll of Stone's Endurance"
msgid ""
