#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/books_lore.json
#. ~ Description of "On the Origin of Species by Means of Natural and
#. Supernatural Selection"
msgid ""
"This is a mass-market paperback copy of Charles Darwin's famous book where he "
"laid out his theory of evolution and the way that magic influences the course "
"of speciation.  The book was extremely controversial when it came out for "
"positing a recent common ancestor for humans and dwarves and for claiming "
"that elves as a distinct species only date back to 3 million years before "
"present."
msgstr ""

