#. ~ Description of "Running on Empty: A Social History of those Born Without
#. Magic"
msgid ""
"A history of the treatment of the \"Empty\", people born with the inability "
"to master even the simplest of spells.  From persecution to favored positions "
"(since rulers could be sure the Empty had no magical means of plotting "
"against them), this book chronicles their treatment across the ages."
