"will \"enhance the subject's resilience against detrimental mutagenic "
"alterations caused by XE037 overexposure, reducing negative outcomes during "
"testing\".  It's stamped with a XEDRA symbol in the corner with \"Project "
"PHAVIAN\" written at the top."
msgstr ""

