msgid ""
"This document details the chemical process necessary to create what it calls "
"Compound XV471, which it claims is a pharmaceutical treatment for a wide "
"variety of ills.  According to this, it acts as a near-universal antivenin, "
"an antifungal, an antiparasitic, an antibiotic, cures several common diseases "
"such as influenza or the common cold, improves the immune system generally, "
"and even increases strength, agility, and overall bodily function.  You would "
"think it was too good to be true if you hadn't seen so many other bizarre "
"things since the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

