#. ~ Description of monster "furious firestarter"
msgid ""
"The air around this person wavers slightly like summer heat, and flames "
"occasionally flicker around their upraised hand.  There is a focused look in "
"their eyes, and they seem to think they can kill every zombie in sight with "
"their powers."
