msgid ""
"The central skylight should be enormous to allow in as much light as "
"possible.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Central Skaylight 4.  Expand the central skylight to very "
"generous dimensions."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
