#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Construct: Climate Control"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will instantly enhance the bunker on your home "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"Craft a Lukewarm Sphere from simple tools and common building materials.  The "
"Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"New Infrastructure: Climate Control.  Control the climate within the bunker "
"so it's not too warm in the summer or too cold in the winter."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"The bunker is expansive, but it's too hot in summer and much too cold in "
"winter.  A climate control system would make it a more comfortable place to "
"rest when not on raids.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Infrastructure: Climate Control.  Control the climate within the bunker "
"so it's not too warm in the summer or too cold in the winter."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid "Construction complete.  The bunker's temperature is now controlled."
msgstr ""

