#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of "Cavernous Soul (North)"
msgid ""
"This strange metaphysical artifact is used to build a structure on the "
"island.  Will be used automatically upon crafting, and can only be used once.\n"
"\n"
"ASSOCIATED BUILD: North Room 4"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Description of mission "Construct: North Side Rooms"
msgid ""
"Completing this mission will instantly build a new structure on your home "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"Craft an Inverted Cube from simple tools and common building materials.  The "
"Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: North Side Rooms.  Add two rooms on either side of the "
"corridor leading to the northern room."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"The northern room is a nice size, but it's just one room.  You could use a "
"bit of separation between activities, and maybe a place to store some "
"materials that you won't use as often.  Time to get to work.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade "
"the island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: North Side Rooms.  Add two side rooms in the north for "
"additional storage."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Sky_Island/upgrade_missions.json
#. ~ Player message in an effect
msgid ""
"Construction complete.  The north now has two side rooms for additional "
"storage."
msgstr ""

