msgid "Monas Hieroglyphica"
msgid_plural "copies of Monas Hieroglyphica"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/spell_learning_items/spellbooks_hedge.json
#. ~ Description of "Monas Hieroglyphica"
msgid ""
"This is a thin reproduction of John Dee's Monas Hieroglyphica.  A complicated "
"work whose meaning has long been lost without access to the occult oral "
"tradition of it's time.  It's possible that some remnants of that oral "
"tradition still exist today, but it is unknown if they would be able to fully "
"interpret this spellbook."
msgstr ""

