"someone that you're pretty sure you had to put down to get here.  There's no "
"hint about the password, though."
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_computers.json
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
msgid "Try hacking the computer"
msgstr ""

#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/talk_computers.json
