"need_to_discuss.mp4\n"
"*It seems to be a part of some video for a newcomer mortician.*\n"
"Host: … Oh, and also, do you remember those small pieces of metal we found "
"covering the skin?  I recommend not throwing it away, but cleaning it up and "
"storing it in some bag - apparently zebra departments really like to buy some "
"of them for a whopping price.\n"
"Cameraman: Do you know why?\n"
"Host: I don't give a shit actually, but 50 bucks per month is 50 bucks per "
"month."
