"looks reminiscent of easier times, but the illusion is broken as he apron "
"shifts to reveal a heavy machete and holstered pistol on  her belt.  She "
"looks up as you approach, then beams in recognition.  \"Welcome to Dana's "
"Bakery, stranger!\"  She laughs brightly.  \"Glad you made out this way.  "
"What can I do for you?\""
