msgstr "Mám plné právo tu být, červe. Práva Squaterů!"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
