#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Well I'll be damned, a fellow survivor!  I'm Darryl, nice to meet you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Well, you got me there.  I sure ain't one to block a fellow farmer's right to "
"reclaim this God-given earth."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "The Lord isn't with you, and that's obvious.  Get out of my sight, sinner."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"It's nice to meet you too, survivor.  It's a tragedy what's become of the New "
"England Church Community, perhaps it'll flourish again someday."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Get away from here, sinner, we don't want your kind here."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "I'm glad you could make it here.  May the Lord have mercy on you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Always nice to meet a fellow outsider.  How can I help you?"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You sure?  I mean, you've been traveling for a long time, haven't you?  "
"Alright, it's your decision.  Let me know when you changed your mind."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oh well, yet another sinner.  Don't talk to me."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local "
"herbalist."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Well now, good to see you again, friend."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "I got my rights to be here, chum.  Squatter's rights!"
msgstr "Mám plné právo tu být, červe. Práva Squaterů!"

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"That ain't the point here, chum.  Don'tcha get it?  This was MY territory, "
"but they took it away from me.  Now they think of us as nothin' but a "
"<freaking> nuisance."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha!  Think before you speak, chum.  Eight icons for an honest day's "
"work, I say the system's broken!"
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Ain't you heard it?  It's been screeching out in the forest during the night "
"for a while now, keeps me up sometimes.  I'm too scared to go out and see "
"what that thing is.  If you'd kill it, I'd be in your debt forever."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"After what you did for me, I'll follow you to the ends of the Earth!  No one "
"around here's stood up for me like that, I owe ya one."
msgstr ""

